<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- NUMANA</book>
  <para style="h">Yɔɔna</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yɔɔna</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yɔɔna</para>
  <para style="mt">Yɔɔna</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Nkan lɛ ne kam te neshir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Ne kuti nkan lɛ ne yime, nkan ilɛmɛ ne yi bǝn Arik, nkan ilɛmɛ ne yi Arik. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Nkan ilɛmɛ ne yi bǝn Arik ne kuti.<verse eid="JHN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Ne atu amaa Arik nena kiki bɔbɔk; bane na ikinuŋ ne yaŋ maa ba. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Nkanlɛ me iyi nkɔŋ kɛ vli, fe ivli kǝŋe ne Gli laŋ amkpa nyɛ aneshire. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Ilaŋa ilaŋ ne bu, ama ibu bane ku ilaŋa iyir ba.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Arik ne shar iner nuŋ; ndi azhɔu sak maa te Yɔɔna. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Iwa ne nyɛ te abla aneshir ilɛ ne atu ayi laŋa, te duŋ aneshir bɔbɔk abɛ wɔ lɛ didik kǝ Arik te tanyɛmɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Iwa Yɔɔna ne tu maa ba wa ayi ilaŋa ba; ne nyɛ te bla ilɛ ne atu waŋ ndi ayi ne laŋa. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Waŋai wa ayi ilaŋ didik ilaŋ yiŋ ndi ne nyɛ gɔnmimi.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Nkan ilɛmɛ ne yi ne gɔnmimi, neme Arik ne na gɔnmimi netu amaa, ne yiŋɛ igɔnmimi bane zhiu ba. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Ne nyɛ ben aneshir amaa, ama aneshir amaa bane tau ba. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Ndi iye amɛ, aneshir abaŋ ndi ne tau ne sak maa tena tanyɛmɛ bene abɔu; atei nek ba mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ yi amumuen abɛ Arik. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Ba ne yi amumun abɛ ŋli ne ikpa kǝŋe ba, bai nŋli kɛ kpa kǝ azhizhi ane kur lulum bǝn iwa ba; Arik wa ne tu maa ayi Tetɛɛ men.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Nkan lɛmɛ ne kam te ineshir tena, shaga ne ta zhɔk bǝn izub, isɔŋ ne miŋ mɔr. Tane yik Ngɔŋ maa, ai ngɔŋ kɛ ta maa ndi Izu ben Tetɛɛ maa.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yɔɔna ne lɛ ne atu amaa, Ne zhin arumɔ te ŋar kɔr te di, &lt;&lt;Waŋa ayi waŋ ndi Mne bla lɛ ne atu amaa ndi Mne ndi, &lt;A nyɛ ne goŋ muŋ, ama ayi Ngɔŋ anaŋ me, te ne amene yime rɛ kuti teshe aŋlim.&gt;&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Ne na iki didik maa ngɔŋ tane ta anu adidik ne atu ayi anu adidik. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Arik wa nɛ nǝk Musa lɛ kɛ cɛr maa; iki didik ben na zub ire ben Yesɔ Kristi. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Ba nuŋ ne zen ayik Arik ba, ama Arik iwa kiki maa, ndi ayi ben Tetɛɛ, ai wa ne duŋ azhiu.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilɛ kɛ Yɔɔna ne su aneshir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Waŋa ayi lɛ kɛ bla Yɔɔna ndi Yahudawa abɛ Urshelima ne shar abɛ na ndum Arik bǝn ine na ndum kǝ Arik te abɛ kɔte rib bu ka ai yi ŋɔwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Bane kyak bla ba, ama ne bla ba lɛ didik te di, &lt;&lt;Nga bam yi Kristi me ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Ne rib bu te di, &lt;&lt;Tǝ uyi ŋɔwai? Uyi Iliya yi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Adi, &lt;&lt;Bam yi wa ba.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">&lt;&lt;Uyi ine bla shar yi Arik yi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Adi, &lt;&lt;Bam yi wa ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Ankyak adiu, &lt;&lt;Tǝ uyi ŋɔwai? bla ta te tabǝ kam te bla abaŋ ndi ne shar tama. Udi uyi ŋɔwai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yɔɔna adi ba te ne cɛr yi Ishaya ine bla shar yi Arik,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">&lt;&lt;Myi kɔr kɛ zhɔ rɛ zizik ndi idi:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 1:23">Izhin bǝ bla lɛ kɛ Arik blabla didik.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Ankyak Ferisawa, anuŋ ndi ne shar ba, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />arib Yɔɔna te di, &lt;&lt;Tǝ usu aneshir te nii teyi ndi bau yi Kristi ba, ka Iliya ne shar ayou Arik?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yɔɔna adi ba, &lt;&lt;Nga msu aneshir ne amashir,&gt;&gt; ama inuŋ ne miŋ min akɛ kli ndi ba zhin ne zhiu ba. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Ayi wa atei nyɛ ne gɔŋ muŋ, ndi bam ne mla ne zuk akpaza amaa ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Bɔbɔk iki yiŋɛ ne nai ne Batiya ne goŋ nek kɛ Urdu, ndi Yɔɔna ne zen su aneshir.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ayi Ŋklu ayou Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Ndi bɛr ne ŋan Yɔɔna ne yik Yesɔ asɔŋ anyɛ ben abɔu te di, &lt;&lt;Tɔ zhin, Nklu ayou Arik, iwaŋ ndi abaŋ zumimin iyi gɔnmimi! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Waŋa ayi wa ndi Mdi, &lt;Ineshir waŋ ndi anyɛ ne goŋ muŋ, ayi ngɔŋ anaŋ me te ne kuti ayime te M shi nyɛ.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Nga muŋ yi bam ne zhiu ba, ama iki yiŋ ndi mne su aneshir ne amashir te bɛ tsar Isrela ne wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Ankyak Yɔɔna ne bla lɛ ne atu amaa: &lt;&lt;Mne yik Izhu nyɛ rɛ shu ndi angu te nyɛ zǝ sɔŋu. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Bam mbǝ zhiu ba, ama ai waŋ ndi ne shar me te Mbǝ su aneshir ai wa ne blam te di, &lt;Iner waŋ ndi uyik Izhu ne zǝ sɔŋu ma ai wa atei su aneshir ne Izhu Tsetser.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Yɔɔna abla te di, &lt;&lt;Mne yik te na tanyɛmɛ te ndi waŋa ayi Izu Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abɛ zǝ Yesɔ tsin abɛ kuti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Ne bɛr yi ku zǝ Yɔɔna ne aklikla bǝn abɛ tsene maa amɛ yaa. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Ndi ne yik Yesɔ agayir, adi, &lt;&lt;Tɔ zhin, Nklu ayou Arik!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Ndi ayaa abɛ tsene maa ne wɔ Yɔɔna adi amɛ, akɔ zǝ Yesɔ. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesɔ akam atɔ, te yik ba azeu arib ba te di, &lt;&lt;Izhin wɔb anii?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Adiu, &lt;&lt;Ine tsar&gt;&gt; Rabbi (watɔ ine tsar), &lt;&lt;Usɔŋ ne mei?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ zhin, izhin tei yik.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:39">Ankyak akɔte yik amkpa waŋ ndi asɔŋɔ, te sɔŋ mla nǝ ku arik ben abɔu. Kǝrfe nas kɛ amgbalu ne vuŋ ba.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Anduru, izumen ane Biturus, ne yi ne miŋ kɛ ayaa abaŋ ndi ne wɔ iki yiŋ ndi Yɔɔna ne di te na zǝ Yesɔ. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Iki yi kuti ndi Andru nenai ne wɔb izumen Biturus te blau te di, &lt;&lt;Ta ne ka yik Almasihu&gt;&gt; (waŋ ndi iwa ai Kristi me). <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Ankyak agliu te gar ben Yesɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Yesɔ ne tɔu te di, &lt;&lt;Uyi Saminu izu Yɔɔna. Atei zhɔu te Kefas&gt;&gt; (Ndi ai Biturus).<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne zhɔ Filibus ben Nataniyel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Ne bɛr yi ku zǝ Yesɔ ne wɔb te iwa abɛ gar Galili. Ndi Yesɔ ne yik Filibus, adiu, &lt;&lt;Zǝm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filibus, ben Anduru bǝn Biturus, are ntun yi Batseda. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filibus ne yik Nataniyel te blau te di, &lt;&lt;Ta ne yik waŋ ndi Musa ne cɛr ne atu amaa, waŋ ndi abɛ bla shar yi Arik nena cɛr. Yesɔ ne Nazara, ndi ayi izu Yusuu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Nataniyel arib, &lt;&lt;Iki didik itei irurɛ Nazara yi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Filibus adiu, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ tɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Ndi Yesɔ ne yik Nataniyel anyɛ bǝn abɔu, alɛ ne atu amaa te di, &lt;&lt;Tɔ awɔnǝ Isrelawa didik, waŋ ndi ba na ki mimin ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Nataniyel aribu te di, &lt;&lt;Une na kikin te zhim?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Mne yigu ndi une nak ri yi ne tiŋ nglǝnglǝ ndi Filibus ne zhɔu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Ankyak Nataniyel adi, &lt;&lt;Ine tsar, uyi Izu Arik; uyi Itum ine Isrela.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Une tanyɛmɛ te Mne blau te ndi Mne yigu ne tiŋ nglǝnglǝ?. Utei yik kiki ngɔngɔŋ yi naŋ yiŋɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Yesɔ nena di, &lt;&lt;Mblau izub, utei yik gbarshu ibu, abɛ shar ayou Arik ayuŋ ate zǝ netu kɛ Izu Neshir.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne kam amashir ate ama Inebi me</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Nǝ bɛr yi ntar nena igyaŋ yi kpa ŋa ne kana kǝ Galili. Iya maa Yesɔ ne yime ne amkpama, <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Yesɔ bǝn abɛ tsene maa ne zhɔ ba ne igyaŋa. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Ndi ama Inebi me ne klɛ, iya maa Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Ama inebi ane igyaŋa neka klɛ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesɔ adiu, iyah, &lt;&lt;Bau tei blam iki yiŋ ndi M tei na ba, mkpaŋ muŋ bane zen te ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Iya maa Yesɔ adi abɛ na ndum amaa, &lt;&lt;Na zhin iki yiŋ ndi ate bla zhin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Yahudawa ayi ne iki yiŋ ndi anai ne ŋla aŋɔk, neme Ancomɔ amɛ tani aklikla ne amkpama, ndi kɔte ancomɔ atawa atei baŋ ambu sɔk yaa bǝn sɔk tar.<verse eid="JHN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesɔ adi abɛ na ndumo, &lt;&lt;Shur zhin amashir shak ancomɔ ma. &gt;&gt; Ankyak akɔ shur amashir ashak ancomɔ ma te duŋu anyɛ anumɔ, <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />ankyak Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Azizaŋa izhin bǝ fa amashir anuŋ Gli iner ne na igyaŋa.&gt;&gt; Ne fa amashir agli iner ne igyaŋa, <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />fe iner ne na igyaŋa asɔ amashire ndi ne kamu ate ama inebi te wɔ mǝne. Bane zhi amkpa awaŋ ndi ne gliu areme ba, ama agene abaŋ ndi ne fa amashire ne zhi. Ankyak azho waŋ ndi akpau ŋama ne kɔnsa <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />te diu, &lt;&lt;kɔte ŋɔwa akuti agli ama inebi ane men agli rumo te Gli ane yaŋ men anyɛ me angɔŋgɔŋ. Ama uwa une su adidige yir te tashi gliu nyɛmɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Waŋa ai iki yi vuŋ anu yi kuti ndi Yesɔ ne nai ne Kana kɛ Galili. Ne amɔ ne Gli Ngɔŋ maa agli arumɔ, abɛ zeu tsin ne tanyɛme ben abɔu.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne gar Akabaŋkɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Ndi yiŋɛ ne gayir Yesɔ bǝn iyaa amaa, bǝn amunzumen,bǝn abɛ tsene maa ne gar Kafanahum. Ne te muɔ bɛr amɔ.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Ndi mkpaŋ kɛ na igyaŋ yi tuk glak yi Yahudawa ne te gbahir, Yesɔ ne gar Urshelima. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Nǝ miŋ Akabakɔŋ ne yik aneshir azǝn lɛb Alandɔŋ, awanta bǝn Tatabara, anuŋ akɔsɔŋ te zen sen azɔb. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Fe ne men ririk kǝ yi ngǝga, te tsik ba ayar rumɔ bɔbɔk ne Akabakɔŋ, awanta ben alandɔŋ; te avar azɔbɔ tena kam iki sak azɔbɔ ku. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Bǝn abaŋ ndi alɛb Tatabara ma adi ba, &lt;&lt;Vu zhin iki yiŋɛ te kam tibɛ zhin ayaŋa! Anii duŋ zhin kam Akabakɔŋ ayou Tetɛɛ amuŋ te idub bo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Abɛ zeu tsin ashu azhi tedi ne cɛr te di: &lt;&lt;Inǝk susun ne Akabakɔŋ ami ne lɛn me susun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Ankyak Yahudawa ne rib bu te di, &lt;&lt;Ayi iki vuŋ anu itayi utei tsar ta neyi tǝ ta bǝ tanyɛme ne mgbyamgbyaŋ keŋ ndi u na kiki yiŋɛi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesɔ mtanyeme ba te di, &lt;&lt;Izhin bǝ zǝr Akabaŋkɔŋ awaŋa, M tei mbaŋ iber tar te meu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Yahudawa adiu, &lt;&lt;Ne baŋ asi sɔk nas te me Akabaŋkɔŋ awaŋa, fe udi utei meu bar tar?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Ama akabaŋkɔŋ ane lɛ amaa ai kpa maa. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Ndi atei lɛgu ne bɛ, abɛ zeu tsin ashu azhi iki yiŋ ndi ne blai. Ankyak mtanyeme ne cɛr ben lɛ keŋ ndi Yesɔ alɛ kɛ.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Neme ndi ne yi ne Urshelima ne igyaŋ yi tuk glak, aneshir tetɛk ne yik iki yi vuŋ anu yiŋ ndi ne nai te tanyɛme ne sak maa. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Ama Yesɔ ba ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɛba ba, te ne zhi asusun aneshir bɔbɔk. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Yesɔ bane wɔb te ineshir abɛ blau ikinuŋ ne atu ayi nuŋ ba, te ne zhi susun kɛ neshir.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ben Nikɔdimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Fe iner nuŋ waŋa ayi awɔnǝ Ferisawa azhɔu te Nikɔdimu, ayi zhin ne miŋ kɛ abɛ gli ntun yi Yahudawa. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Ne nyɛ yik Yesɔ ne bu tedi, &lt;&lt;Ine Tsar, tane zhi te uyi Ine Tsar waŋ ndi ure bǝn Arik. Iner nuŋ batei na kiki ngɔŋgɔŋ iyi sak aŋɔk nenu mba waŋ ndi Arik ayi ne atu maa ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesɔ asagu ma tedi, &lt;&lt;Mblau lɛ didik, inuŋ batei yik kɔb ngɔŋ kɛ Arik ba se nena ŋliu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />&lt;&lt;Ai na kikin te ŋli ner ndi neka cɛi?&gt;&gt; Nikɔdimu arib. &lt;&lt;Ka inere atei kam ayir imiŋ ne kɛ iya maa te abɛ kama ŋliu kpaŋ kɛ yaa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Mblau izub, inuŋ batei yik ikɔb kǝ Arik ba se ne ŋliu ne amashir bǝn Izhu Tsetser. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Iner ne azhizhi aŋli ner ne azhizhi, fe Izhu tsetser ina nŋli ine yi ne Izhu tsester. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Duŋ vuŋ anu nǝ ki yi bla muŋ yiŋɛ ba, &lt;Se ne akam aŋliu baliŋ.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Nguŋgu fuk gar amkpawaŋ ndi ne teu, uwɔ igu maa, ama bau tei bla tedi ire amɛ ka ikɔmɔ ne amɛ ba. Iyeme netu ayi waŋ ndi ne ŋliu ne Izhu Tsetser.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikɔdimu arib. &lt;&lt;Ai na kikin te bǝ yi amei?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />&lt;&lt;Uyi ine tsar ne Isrela,&gt;&gt; Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;fe bɔu nǝ zhi kiki yiŋɛ ka? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Mblau izub, ta bla ikiyiŋ ndi tane zhi, tena ta nyɛmɛ ne ki yiŋ ndi tane yik, ne yiŋɛ izhineba aneshir ba zhin tanyɛmɛ ne ilɛ kǝ bla mɔr ba. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Mne lɛ bene bɛ zhin ne atu kiki yi gɔnmimi ama izhin ne kyak tanyɛmɛ; te izhin tei na kikin te tanyɛmɛ ate yi ndi ilɛ muŋɔ iyi ne atu kiki iyi gbarshu? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Inuŋ bane zen akɔmɔ ne shu ba anaga yi iwaŋ ndi ne nyɛ rɛ shu, Izu Neshir. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Ndi Musa ane lɛk zɔb kɛ yi ndi iwa ne tu kuŋkun ne ahwaŋ, iyi amɛ atei lɛk Izu Neshir ne shu, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />te iwaŋ ndi ate tanyɛmɛ bene bɔu ai ka yik ivli kɛ yaŋ klɛtu.<verse eid="JHN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />&lt;&lt;Tǝ Arik ne anyer gɔnmimi tetɛk te nek mgbyaŋ zhin Zu maa ankyak, te kɔte ŋɔwa ndi ate tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɔu ba atei ku ba ama atei ta ivli kɛ yaŋ klɛtu. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Tǝ Arik bane shar Izu maa ne gɔnmimi te abɛ te aner abɛ gɔnmimi me ambuk ba, ama abɛ yik ita zhɔk ne aŋɔk amaa.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Iwaŋ ndi ate tanyɛmɛ bǝn Izu Arik bai cɔkla ba, fena iwaŋ ndi ate kyak tanyɛmɛ bene bɔu neka teu ambuk, te ne akyak tanyɛmɛ bǝn Izu Arik izhiin iwa ayi Izu kiki maa. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Waŋa ayi ndi ambuk go te yime: Ilaŋ abɛm ne nyɛ gɔnmimi, ama aner tetɛk ne nyer ibu anaŋ ilaŋa te kiki iyi na mǝne yi mimin. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Iwaŋ ndi ate na ki mimin akyak ilaŋa, batei nyɛ amkpa ane laŋ ba ne sisik te kiki iyi na maa atei yigǝ ne bɛm. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Fena abaŋ ndi ana iki didik anyɛ amkpa ane laŋ, teduŋ abɛ yik kiki iyi na maa ne laŋ, te iki iyi na maa iyi ne nkɔŋ kɛ Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɔɔna ne lɛ ne atu Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Iyiŋɛ ne gayir, Yesɔ bǝn abɛ tsene maa aru akɔmɔ ne Yahudiya igar ntun, amɔ Yesɔ ne baŋ mkpaŋ bene ba, te azǝn su aneshir. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Neme Yɔɔna maayi azǝn su aneshir ne Aino yaŋ Salim, te amɔ amashir ayime tetɛk, ndi aneshir kɔte mkpaŋ takɛ agar tǝ bɛ su ba amɔ. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />(Ikime ne men yi amɛ te she alɔ zhɔk Yɔɔna ne jaru.) <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Iga aŋa ilu bǝn anuŋ abɛ zǝ Yɔɔna tsen bǝn awɔnǝ Yahudawa nuŋ netu ayi ŋla kpa. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Anyɛ bǝn Yɔɔna te diu, &lt;&lt;Ine tsar, iner yuŋɔ ndi ayi bene bɔu ne garke Urdu iwaŋ ndi une lɛ ne atu amaa ngɔŋ, azǝn su aneshir, neme kɔte ŋɔ agar bene bɔu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Ndi amɛ Yɔɔna adi, &lt;&lt;Iner ai ta ikiyiŋ ndi ne nǝgu neyi are shu ankyak. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Izhineba minyi izhin tei tanyɛme ne kiyi bla muŋɔ, Ba ngam yi Kristi me ba ne shar me ankyak tem mkuti maa.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Ilulum ne wɔb ikpa ŋa yayas. Ikpa waŋ di ayi ne amkpa ane kpa ŋama ashur atɔŋ te wɔ ki ndi ne kpa ŋama ai di, ai na nyɛr ngɔŋ ndi ate wɔ kɔr kɛ ne kpa ŋama. Nyɛr yuŋɔ iyi muŋ, fe inyɛre itashi shaga. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Atei yi ngɔŋ; Ngam M tei yi vǝtsɔb.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwaŋ ndi are gbarshu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Yesɔ ndi are shu ayi netu ki bɔbɔk; iwaŋ ndi are gɔnmimi ayi ne gɔnmimi, te ne lɛ ndi ne rɛ gɔnmimi. ama iwaŋ ndi are shu ayi ne atu aneshir bɔbɔk. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Ne bla kiyiŋ ndi wa neyik tena wɔi, ama inuŋ bane tanyɛmɛ ne ilɛ kɛ blama ba. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Iwaŋ ndi ne ta ilɛmɛ ne ta ilɛ kɛ Arik te iyi zub. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Tǝ iwaŋ ndi Arik ne sharu ma abla ilɛ kɛ Arik, te Arik anǝk Izhu maa iyaŋ mkpaŋ. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Tetɛɛ anyer Izu maa tena baŋ kɔte nii asak ne aŋɔk amaa. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Iwaŋ ndi ate tanyɛmɛ bǝn izu maa ayi ne vli kɛ yaŋ klɛtu, ama iwaŋ ndi ate kyak mfu kɛ Arik itei yi netu kɛ neshire.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne lɛ ben iwa ane Samariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Iferisawa awɔ te isak Yesɔ kɔmɔ ngɔŋ te ana su aner tetɛk abɛ zeu inaŋ abɛ Yɔɔna, <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Nǝ yiŋɛ bai Yesɔ wa ayi ne su aneshire ba, ayi abɛ zeu tsǝn amaa. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Yesɔ ne duŋ ba ne Yahudiya te kama kɔmɔ ne Galili.<verse eid="JHN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Fe ne kama zǝ Samariya. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Ankyak ne yir ntun nuŋ yiŋɛ ne Samariya azhɔi te Sika, yaŋ ahwaŋ awaŋ ndi Yakubu ane lɛb zu maa Yusuu. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Irijaa kǝ Yakubu iyi amɔ, ndi Yesɔ nɛ dǝk, nɛ rɛ itsin maa, alɔ zǝ sɔŋ nenu irijaa ma. Nɛ atsutsu arik.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Ndi iwa ane Samariya ne nyɛ fa amashir, Yesɔ adi iwa ma, &lt;&lt;Udik amashir nǝm msɔi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Abɛ zeu na ndum amaa ne gar lɛb ikili ne miŋ ntun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Iwa ane Samariya ma adi Yesɔ, &lt;&lt;Uyi awɔnǝ Yahudawa te ngam yi iwa ane Samariya. Udi urib me amashir kikini?&gt;&gt; (Tǝ Yahudawa ate zor ne akpa ben aner abɛ Samariya.)<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Abɛdi une zhi inǝk yi Arik ben waŋ ndi aribu amashir ane somɔ, ubǝ rib bu ai bɛ nǝgu amashir atsitsir.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />&lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ,&gt;&gt; Iwama adi, &lt;&lt;Bau yi ne goga ka te rijaa ma ilak ngɔŋ. Utei yik amashir ane so te yi tsitsir nemei? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Uwa unaŋ ntsǝntsǝm amɔr Yakubu, uwaŋ ndi wa ne kaa ta rijaa kǝŋe tena so amashire maayi, neme amun amaa bǝn inarum abɛ yɔk amaa ne so amashire?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Iwaŋ ndi ate so amashir awaŋa ihrie tei na teu, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />ama iwaŋ ndi ate so amashir ane nek amuŋ ba ihrie tei na teu ba. Iyeme, amashir ane nek amuŋɔ atei kama yi ane yaŋ gbur agbub te gar ivli kɛ yaŋ klɛtu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Iwama adi Yesɔ, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, nǝm amashir ayuŋɔ te kɛ ihrie bena tem ba tem mkana nduŋ nyɛ fa amashir ayaŋa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesɔ ablau, &lt;&lt;Tsǝn, tǝ zhɔ ilu mi te kam nyak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />&lt;&lt;Bam yine lulum ba,&gt;&gt; iwama asagu ma, Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Ubla zub ndi udi bau yine lulum ba. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Ilɛ kǝ zub keŋ, une ŋa alulum ndi ne te amɛ tuŋ, fe iwaŋ ndi uŋau ma ba yi ilu mi ba. Iki yiŋ ndi usɔŋ blai ma ai lɛ didik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />&lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, iwama adi, &lt;&lt;Myik te uyi ine bla shar yi Arik. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Atsentsem amɔr azekur Arik ne gbu yiŋɛ, ama izhineba Yahudawa kyerta tedi amkpa awaŋ ndi tabǝ zǝ kuu Arik ge ayi ne Urshelima.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesɔ abla iwama, &lt;&lt;Ta nyɛmɛ bene bɛm, iwa, mkpaŋ nyɛ ndi izhin ntei zekuru Tetɛɛ bane gbu yiŋɛ kɔ ne Urshelima ba. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Izhineba aner abɛ Samariya izhin zǝ kuu iki yiŋ ndi ba zhin ne zhi ba; taba Yahudawa ta zekuru ki ndi tane zhi, te ita zhɔk ire ben Yahudawa. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Neme mkpaŋ nyɛ fe azizaŋa ne nyɛ ndi abɛ zekuru Arik Tetɛɛ mɔr anenen atei zekuru ne Izhu bǝn izub, te aba ayi abɛ aner abaŋ ndi Arik awɔb. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Arik ayi Izhu, fena ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ zhu abɛ zekuru ne izhu bǝn zub.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Iwama adi, &lt;&lt;Mni nzhi Mezaya&gt;&gt; (azhɔu te Kristi) &lt;&lt;anyɛ. Ate nyɛ, atei bla ta kɔte nii.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Fe Yesɔ abla ilɛmɛ arumɔ, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ ndi mli bene bɔu myi wa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abɛ zeu tsǝn amaa anyɛ yik Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Ndi abɛ zeu tsǝn amaa ne nyak akɔ vuŋ anu ndi ayigu azǝn lɛ ben iwa ane Samariya. Ama inuŋ bane ne rib iwama ba, &lt;&lt;Uwɔb anii?&gt;&gt; kɔ &lt;&lt;Aye nii te Ulɛ ben iwa waŋai?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Ankyak, akɔ duŋ ancomɔ ane fa amashir amaa, te klu akama kɔmɔ ne miŋ ntun te azho aneshir,<verse eid="JHN 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />&lt;&lt;Nye zhin, tɔ zhin ner ndi ablam kiki ndi mne nai. Ka uwa ayi Kristi me ini?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Fe aner aklu aru ne miŋ ntuno te gar ben Yesɔ. <verse eid="JHN 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Neme abɛ tsene maa adiu, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, li kinuŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Ama adi ba, &lt;&lt;Myi ne kili yi li ndi ba zhin ne zhi atu amaa ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Fe abɛ zeu tsǝn amaa arib akpa men, &lt;&lt;Tǝ iner nuŋ nǝ lɔ gliu kili mei?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Ikili muŋ,&gt;&gt; mbǝ na kiyiŋ ndi ne shar me ne dim nai tem mklɛ ndum maa. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Dika izhin di, &lt;Ihwa nas ne dǝk tǝ bɛ Gli kili ye ahwaŋ aŋyak kɔbɔ&gt;? Mblaazhin, bu zhin ayi te tɔ zhin ahwaŋa! Ikime ne rǝ mla sɛr gli nyak kɔb. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />kɔ azizaŋa iner ne ahwaŋa ai ta idǝk maa, kɔ azizaŋa ikili yi biŋe iyi ndi aneshir abaŋ ndi ne gli ba te gar ikɔb kɛ yaŋ klɛtu tǝ bɛ ta idǝk men. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Iyiŋɛ ne idi, &lt;Inuŋ atib fe inuŋ ana sɛr &gt; ayi izub. <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Mne shar zhin te sɛr kiyiŋ ndi ba izhineba ne na ndumo ba. Aye nuŋ aba nena ndum kɛ lɔk akpa, fe izhin ne te sɛr idǝk keŋ ndi iyi mǝne.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aner abɛ Samariya tetɛk ne tanyɛme ben Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Aner abɛ Samariya tetɛk ne ntuno ne tanyɛmɛ bene bɔu nǝ lɛ kɛ bla iwama, &lt;&lt;Ne blam kiki ndi mne nai.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Fena ndi aner abɛ Samariya ma ne nyɛ bǝn abɔu, abenu te abɛ sɔŋ bene ba, fe ne te bɛr yaa amɔ. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Ndi ne atu ayi lǝlɛ maa anuŋ tetɛk tanyɛmɛ te zeu. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Adi iwama, &lt;&lt;Ba ta ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn Yesɔ te une bla ta ba; azizaŋa tane wɔ ne atɔŋ amɔr, tena tanyɛmɛ te iner waŋa ilɛ didik ayi ne ta aner abɛ gɔnmimi azhɔk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ nena Izu ner ŋgɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Ndi bɛr yaa ne gayir alu akɔmɔ ne Galili. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />(Fe Yesɔ ne tu maa ne bla tedi ine bla shar yi Arik ba nǝgu ngɔŋ ne ntun maa ba.) <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Ndi ne yir Galili, aner abɛ Galili atau aŋɔk ayaa. Neyik kiki iyi na maa ne Urshelima ne igyaŋ yi glak, te aba ne yime amɔ. <verse eid="JHN 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Nena akam agar Kana ne Galili, ndi ane kam amashir ate ayime. Ankyak iner ŋgɔŋ nuŋ waŋ ndi ŋur zu maa zhɔk ne Kafanahum. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Ndi neshire ne awɔ te Yesɔ ne nyɛ Galili are Yahuda, agar bene bɔu te benu te abɛ nyɛ na zu maa, ndi akur agbaŋ iku. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Ba nuŋ atei tanyɛmɛ ba se izhin aneshir ne yik kiki iyi vuŋ anu be bǝn shur ayi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Iner adi, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, nyara te zumuŋɔ aku.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;kɔmɔ kimi; Izumi atei rɛ!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Iner ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn Yesɔ te kɔmɔ. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Ndi ayi ne miŋ kɛ tsǝn kɔmɔ, igen amaa amla bene bɔu te blau te vǝvǝne neka rɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Ne rib bu mkpaŋ keŋ ndi vǝvǝne ne rɛ, adiu, &lt;&lt;Ilɔmɔ ne duŋu alaŋ aririk ne Kǝrfe zhin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Fe itetɛɛ me akɔ shuzhi te ayi mkpaŋa kɛ anenen Yesɔ ne diu, &lt;&lt;Izumi atei rɛ.&gt;&gt; Amɛ uwa bǝn aner abɛ kɔb maa ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn Yesɔ.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Iyiŋɛ ai mkpaŋ kɛ yaa nena ki ngɔngɔŋ iyi vuŋ anu ndi Yesɔ nena, ne rɛ Yahudiya maa te kɔmɔ ne Galili.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne na neshir ne nkam kɛ Betasda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Ne bar nuŋ, Yesɔ ne gar igyaŋ yi Yahudawa ne Urshelima. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Nǝ Urshelima nkam yi gbahir ne Ankɔŋ ne Awanta, ne aŋa yi Yahudawa azho kɛ te Betasda ne na abur amɛ tuŋ ndi ne kpaŋa ne gɔŋ nkama ari. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Abɛ lɔ tetɛk akɔkur ne aki mɛ, abɛ amfik, abɛ kpuk, ben abɛ ku gar zhin. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Amkpa mkpaŋ ne shar ayou Arik anyɛ te ruk amashir ane kama. Atei na amɛ abɛ lɔmɔ awɔb te aba bǝ tuk yir kama. Iwaŋ ndi wa te kuti yir amashire ate rɛ, kɔte yi ne ir lɔ tayi. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Iner nuŋ ndi akɔkur amɔ ilɔ ne vuŋu ase sɔk tar ane tender. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Ndi Yesɔ ne yigu akɔkur amɔ te zhi te iner waŋ ilɔ ne men vuŋu rɛ kukub, Yesɔ arib nɛrɛ te di, &lt;&lt;Uwɔb te ubǝ rei?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Ine lɔmɔ atanyɛmɛ tedi, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Bam yi ne ner nuŋ ndi atei lɔk mǝ ma te baŋ me azhɔk ne nkam amashir ndi ineshar Arik ate ruk nkama. Mte wɔb te bǝ yir amashire, inuŋ ana kumti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Ankyak Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Lu kli! Baŋ atakpa ami te kɔmɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Inere akɔ rɛ ne amkpamkpama; abaŋ atakpa amaa te kɔmɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Ibar yiŋ ndi iki yiŋɛ ne na ai bɛr yi sɔŋ sik yi Yahudawa, <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />neme Yahudawa adi neshir waŋ ndi Yesɔ ne duŋu arɛ mɛ, &lt;&lt;waŋa ai bɛr yi sɔŋ sik; ilɛ kɛ kpa nyak mɔr ne yaru bǝ baŋ atakpa mi te kɔmɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Ama iner ne lɔme adi ba, &lt;&lt;Iner waŋ ndi ne duŋ me rɛmɛ ai wa ne dim, &lt;Baŋ atakpa mi te kɔmɔ.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Ankyak aribu te di, &lt;&lt;Ai ŋɔwa ne diu ubǝ baŋ agurhwa ami te kɔmɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Iner waŋ ndi ne rɛ me ba ne zhi ka ai ŋɔwa ne duŋ wa are ba, te Yesɔ ne ka yir miŋ ntsan aneshir ndi ayi amɔ.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Nǝ mkpaŋ nuŋ Yesɔ ne yigu ne Akabakɔŋ te diu, &lt;&lt;Uyik, une ka rɛ. Duŋ na zumimin te ikinuŋ mimin ilu vuŋu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Inere akɔte bla Yahudawa te di ai Yesɔ wa ne duŋ wa are.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ivli ire ben Izu Neshir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Fe ndi Yesɔ ne zen duŋ aneshir are ne bɛr yi sɔŋ sik yi Yahudawa, Yahudawa ne sagu iyah. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Yesɔ ne di ba, &lt;&lt;Tetɛɛ amuŋ ana ndum kɔte bar tayi, Nga, muŋ yi, M tei na ndum.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Neme Yahudawa ne wɔb ankɔŋ ane ŋun Yesɔ; ba yaŋ zǝ bɛr yi sɔŋ sik ankyak ba, ama azho Arik te Tetɛɛ amaa, te tsar itu maa anenen ben Arik.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesɔ ne bla ba te di: &lt;&lt;Mbla zhin lɛ didik, ivǝn ba na iki nuŋ kiki maa ba; anak ana iki yiŋ ndi ne yik Tetɛɛ maa anai, te iki yiŋ ndi Tetɛɛ te nai ai yi Izu maa anai. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Itetɛɛ anyer Izu maa te tsa ru bɔbɔk iki yiŋ ndi anai. Amɛ, ne sak aŋɔk ne anu min atei tsa ru ikiki gɔngɔŋ anaŋ yiŋɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Ir keŋ ndi Tetɛɛ alɛk abɛ ku alumɔ te nek ba ivli, neme Izu maa atei nek waŋ ndi asigu susun ivli. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Neme, Tetɛɛ ba ne te nuŋ ambuk ba, ama ne nek izu maa mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ te aneshir bɔbɔk ambuk, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />te aneshir bɔbɔk abɛ nek zu maa ŋgɔŋ ndi anǝk Tetɛɛ me. Iwaŋ ndi ba te nek Izumɔ ngɔŋ ba ba nek Tetɛɛ me ŋgɔŋ ba, waŋ ndi ne sharu.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />Mbla zhin lɛ didik, iwaŋ ndi ate wɔ lɛ muŋ te tanyɛmɛ bǝn waŋ ndi ne shar me ayi ne ivli kɛ yaŋ klɛtu Arik batei teu ambuk ba; ne glɔ iku te yik ivli. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Mbla zhin lɛ didik, mkpaŋ te nyɛ ne ka nyɛ ma ndi abaŋ ndi ne ku atei wɔ kɔr kɛ Izu Arik abaŋ ndi ate wɔ te tanyɛmɛ ne kǝ atei yi atsitsir. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Ir keŋ ndi Tetɛɛ ayi ne vli ne tu maa, amɛ ne nek izu maa mgbyamgbyaŋ abɛ yi ne tu maa. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Nena nǝgu mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ te ambuk te iwa ayi Izu Neshir.<verse eid="JHN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />&lt;&lt;Kǝr zhin bǝ sak aŋɔk ne anu ne ikiki yiŋɛ ba, te mkpaŋ sɔŋ nyɛ ndi bɔbɔk abaŋ ndi ayi ne miŋ abɛ men atei wɔ kɔr maa <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />te ru abɛm, abaŋ ndi ne na iki didik atei lu te vli, abaŋ ndi ne na zumimin atei te ba ambuk te shur ba ne lu. <verse eid="JHN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Nga kiki muŋ bam M tei na ikinuŋ kiki muŋ ba; mte ambuk ir keŋ ndi mwɔ, mte ambuk tetɛɛ didik, bam wɔb te bǝ na itu muŋ didik ba ama mbǝ na iwaŋ ndi ne shar me.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibla lɛ ne atu ayi Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />&lt;&lt;Ate yi ndi M tei bla kinuŋ ne atu muŋ, ilɛ kɛ bla muŋ bai zub ba ayi kisha. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Ama inuŋ ayime ndi abla ikinuŋ ne atu muŋ, mne zhi te abla zub ne atu muŋ.<verse eid="JHN 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Izhin ne shar ben Yɔɔna ne bla zhin lɛ didik. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Bam ta bla ikinuŋ bǝn neshir ba; ama mne bla amɛ te izhin yik ita zhɔk. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yɔɔna ne yi ilu ndi ilaŋ te nek laŋ amkpa, izhin ne tanyɛmɛ ne mkpaŋ watsɔb te wɔ men kɛ laŋ amkpama.<verse eid="JHN 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />&lt;&lt;Me yi ne iki yi bla ne atu muŋ naŋ yi Yɔɔna. Te ndum keŋ ndi Tetɛɛ ne nǝm ne kɛ te bǝ klɛ kɛ, ai kɛ mna kɛ, itsar te ai Tetɛɛ wa ne shar me. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Tetɛɛ waŋ ndi ne shar me ne bla lɛ ne atu muŋ. Ba zhin ne yigu ba ba zhin ne wɔ kɔr maa ba, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />ilɛ maa ba ne zisɔŋ ne susun amin ba, te ba zhin ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn waŋ ndi ne sharu ba. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Izhin nak tɔ icɛr ilɛ kɛ Arik ngɔŋ te yik te di ai yi te nek zhin ivli kɛ yaŋ klɛtu. Waŋ ayi cɛr yiŋ ndi bla lɛ muŋ, <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />neme izhin ne kyak nyɛ ben abɛm te ta ivli.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />&lt;&lt;Bam nǝ ta gbar asak ben aneshir ba, <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />ama mne zhi zhin. Mne zhi te ba zhin ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn Arik ne susun min ba. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Mne nyɛ ne sak kɛ Tetɛɛ muŋ, ba zhin ne tam ba; ama inuŋ ate nyɛ ne sak maa, izhin tei tau. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Izhin te na kikin te tanyɛmɛ te yi ndi izhin ta gbar asak ben akpa, te izhin kyak wɔb gbar asak ndi ire ben Arik?<verse eid="JHN 5:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />&lt;&lt;Ama kǝr zhin bǝ yik te di M tei gli zhin te gar ambuk bǝn Tetɛɛ. Ai Musa wa atei gli zhin te gar ambuk, uwaŋ ndi izhin shur ayi bǝn abɔu. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Izhin te tanyɛme ben Musa, izhin tei tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɛm. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Ama ba izhin ne tanyɛmɛ ne cɛr maa ba, izhin tei na kikin te tanyɛmɛ bǝn ilɛ kǝ bla muŋǝ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne yɔk aner azhin atuŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Ndi yiŋɛ ne gayir, Yesɔ ne glɔ gɔŋ nek kɛ Galili (ndi ai inǝk ne Tibiriya), <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />ankyak ntsan aneshir azeu te ne yik ikiki yi vuŋ anu ndi ne nai ndi ne duŋ abɛ lɔ are. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Fe Yesɔ ne yuŋ tu Igbu te zǝ sɔŋ ben abɛ zeu tsin. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Igyaŋ yi tuk glak yi Yahudawa ne te gbahir.<verse eid="JHN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Ndi Yesɔ ne lɛk tu te yik ntsan aneshir tetɛk nyɛ ben abɔu, adi Filibus, &lt;&lt;Tatǝ yik borodi tetɛk ne amɛ te lɛb nek aneshir abaŋa atai?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Yesɔ ne rib amɛ ankyak te abɛ tsa ru atɔ, te ne ai ka mǝne zhi ne susun maa iki yiŋ ndi wa atei na.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filibus adi Yesɔ, &lt;&lt;Azɔb amkplik ayaa ba te mla lɛb borodi keŋ ndi inuŋ atei yik watsɔb ba!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Inuŋ ne miŋ kɛ abɛ tsene maa ndi azhɔu te, Anduru, izumen ane Biturus, adi Yesɔ, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />&lt;&lt;Tɔ vǝvǝn nuŋ agli mbwab daŋ kɛ yuk me tuŋ ben ambɛ mwɔ tsɔtsɔb amɛ ayaa, ama ba atei mla nek Ntsan aneshir abaŋa ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Duŋ zhin aneshire azesɔŋ.&gt;&gt; Agǝga tetɛk ne yi ne amkpama, ankyak alulum ne zǝ sɔŋ, atei mla azhiin atuŋ. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Ankyak Yesɔ abaŋ mplipla la, te nyɛr Arik, te gab abaŋ ndi ne zǝ sɔŋ ir keŋ ndi tei mla ba. Tena na amɛ ne ambɛ me.<verse eid="JHN 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Ndi ne ka li kili ahri, Yesɔ adi abɛ zeu tsin amaa, &lt;&lt;Biŋ zhin nki kili yiŋ ndi ne dǝk. kǝr zhin bǝ duŋ ikinuŋ cɔkla ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Fe ne biŋ nki mplipla la bǝn ambɛ me bɔbɔk ne shak sisa mei wur aneyaa yiŋ ndi ne li te duŋǝ.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Ndi aneshir ne yik iki vuŋ anu ndi Yesɔ ne na, fe adi, &lt;&lt;Ai lɛ didik waŋ ai ine bla shar yi Arik ndi atei nyɛ gɔnmimi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yesɔ, ne men azhi te awɔb nyɛnu Itum ne mgbyamgbyaŋ, ankyak aduŋ ba te gar itugbu wa kiki maa.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne tsǝn ne atu amashir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Ndi amgbalu ne te abɛ zeu tsin ne gar inǝk, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />ne amuɔ ne yir igu keŋ ndi igar ŋɔk Kafanahum. Ibu ne te Yesɔ bane zen anyɛ bǝn abǝba ba. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Nguŋgu ne te ngɔŋ te duŋ Amashir ne inǝk ne lu ankun. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Ndi ne tsin ne igumɔ gab aza tar kɔ nas, ne yik Yesɔ atsetsen ne atu amashir, te anyɛ ben abɛba ne gumɔ, ankyak sisik te ba. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Ama Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Ai nga; kǝr te zhin sisik ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Ankyak ne wɔb te aba bǝ baŋu ne igumɔ, fe igumɔ yir kɔtɔŋ inǝk ne amkpa ne zi amen.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Ne bɛr yi ku zǝ ntsan aneshir abaŋ ndi ne klikli ne ŋɔk nek ne zhi te anak igu zhiin ndi ne kpa kɛ yak amɔ, ndi Yesɔ bǝn abɛ tsene maa ba ne yir kɛ ba, anak abɛ zeu tsin ankyak ne yir gumɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Igu muɔtsɔtsɔb nuŋ ne rɛ Tibariya te nyɛ gbahir ne amkpa waŋ ndi aneshir ne ta mbwab daŋ ndi Yesɔ ne nyɛr Arik te nek ba ne kǝ. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Ndi ntsan aneshir ne zhi te Yesɔ ben abɛ zeu tsin ba yi ne amkpa ma ba, ne yir gu te gar Kafanahum te gar wɔb Yesɔ.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ayi ndi kili ye nek vli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Ndi ne yigu ne ŋɔk nek yuŋ, aribu te di, &lt;&lt;Ne tsar, une nyɛ ayaŋa atentai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Mbla zhin lɛ didik, izhin wɔb me, bai lɛ kɛ yik iki yi vuŋ anu ndi mne nai ba ama ai ir keŋ ndi izhin ne ta mplipla la ihri. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Kǝr izhin bǝ na ndum kɛ ikili yi cɔkla ba, ama izhin bǝ wɔb ikili yiŋ ndi ba te cɔkla ba iyi nek ivli, waŋa ayi kili ndi izu neshir atei nek zhin neyi. Ndi Arik Tetɛɛ ne nǝgu mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ na me.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Ankyak aribu te di, &lt;&lt;Ta tei na kikin te na ndum ndi Arik awɔb yi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Waŋ ayi iki yiŋ ndi Arik awɔb te abɛ nai: abɛ tanyɛmɛ bǝn iwaŋ ndi ne sharu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Fe aribu te di, &lt;&lt;Ai iki vuŋ anu itei utǝ nai te ta bǝ tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɔu? Utei na anii? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Atsintsim amɔr ne ta kili ne zizik; &lt;Arik ne nek ba kili kɛ rɛ gbarshu ata.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Mbla zhin izub, ba ne Musa wa ne nek zhin kili kɛ rɛ shu ba, ama ne yi tetɛɛ muŋ wa ne nek zhin kili didik kɛ rɛ shu. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />kili kɛ Arik ai waŋ ndi ne zǝǝ are shu te nyɛ mimi te nek gɔnmimi ivli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Adi, &lt;&lt;Ngɔŋ&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ivuŋ rɛ azizaŋa nek ta kili yiŋɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Ankyak Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Nga myi borodi kɛ nek ivli. Iwaŋ ndi atei nyɛ ben abɛm ba te na wɔ ikasa ba, iwaŋ ndi atei na tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɛm ihre ba te na teu ba. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Ama ir keŋ ndi mneka mbla zhin, izhin ne yik me ama ba zhin ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɛm ba. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Bɔbɔk abaŋ ndi Tetɛɛ ne nǝm ne ba atei nyɛ ben abɛm, iwaŋ ndi ate nyɛ ben abɛm bam te yaru ba. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Te mne nyɛ ire gbarshu ba me na iki yi susun muŋ ba ama bǝ na iki yiŋ ndi ne shar me awɔb yi. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Waŋa ai ikiyiŋ ndi ne shar me awɔb yi, kǝr mbǝ tyak inuŋ ne miŋ kɛ abaŋ ndi ne nǝm aba zhɔk ba, ama mbǝ lɛk ba ne bar klɛtu. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Iki wɔb Tetɛɛ amuŋ ai iwaŋ ndi ate yik izu maa te na tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɔu atei yik ivli kɛ yaŋ klɛtu, Nga M tei lɛk ba ne bar klɛtu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Ankyak Yahudawa alɛ mumur ne atu maa te di, &lt;&lt;Mǝ yi kili yiŋ ndi rɛ gbarshu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Adi, &lt;&lt;Di waŋa ai Yesɔ kai, izu Yusuu, ndi ta ne zhi iya maa ben tetɛɛ maa? fe te na kikin di, &lt;me rɛ gbarshu&gt;?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;izhin bǝ duŋ lɛ zhin mumur ne akpa min.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />&lt;&lt;Ba nuŋ ate nyɛ ben abɛm ba se waŋ ndi Tetɛɛ muŋ ne gliu anyɛ ben abɛm, fe nga M tei luk ba ngli lumɔ ne bar klɛtu. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Icɛr yi abɛ bla shar yi Arik idi: &lt;&lt;Arik atei tsar ba bɔbɔk mǝne.&gt; waŋ ndi ate wɔ Tetɛɛ te na zǝ tsar maa anyɛ ben abɛm. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Ba nuŋ ne yik Arik ba se waŋ ndi are ben Arik; ne nak yik tetɛɛ ankyak. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Mbla zhin lɛ didik, waŋ ndi ate tanyɛmɛ ayi ne ivli kɛ yaŋ klɛ tu. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Myi kili yi nek ivli. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Atsintsim amin ne ta kili ne zizik, neme ne ku. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Ama kili nuŋ ire gbarshu, ndi neshir ate ta kɛ bai ku ba. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Me yi kili yi nek ivli ndi ire gbarshu. Iwaŋ ndi atei ta borodi kǝŋe, ba te ku ba. Ikili yiŋɛ ai ina kpa muŋ, te gɔnmimi bǝ yik ivli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Ankyak Yahudawa ne te antam te vǝ ngɔŋ ne akpa men te di, &lt;&lt;Iner waŋ atei na kikin te nek ta ina kpa maa ta ta?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Me bla zhin lɛ didik, se zhin ne ta ina kpa kɛ zu neshir te so azhizhi maa, mba amɛ ba izhin ba te yik ivli ba. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Iwaŋ ndi ate ta ina kpa muŋ tena so azhizhi amuŋ ayi ne ivli kɛ yaŋ klɛ tu, M tei lugu Gli lumɔ ne bar klɛ tu. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Tǝ ina kpa muŋ ai kili didik ben azhizhi amuŋ ai ki so didik. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Iwaŋ ndi ate ta ina kpa muŋ te ne so azhizhi amuŋ ayi ben abɛm, nga mne yi ben aba. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Ir keŋ ndi tetɛɛ tsitsir ne shar me te mne yi tsitsir ne atu maa, ne me iwaŋ ndi nga me yiu ikili maa atei yi tsitsir ne atu muŋ. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Waŋ ayi kili ndi ire gbarshu. Atsentsem amin ne li kili te ku, ama waŋ ndi ate li kili kǝŋe ba tei ku ba atei yi tsitsir yaŋ klɛtu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Ne bla lǝlɛ yiŋɛ ne zen tsar ne Akaba ne Kafanahum.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilɛ kɛ ivli kɛ yaŋ klɛtu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Abɛ zǝ Yesɔ tsen anuŋ tetɛk ne wɔ amɛ te di, &lt;&lt;Waŋ ayi tsar yi lɔmɔ. Iŋɔwa atei zhi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yesɔ ne zhi te abɛ zeu tsin azǝn lɛ mumur, adi ba, &lt;&lt;Ilɛ kǝŋe ne cɔk asusun min lai? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Ate yiŋ ndi zhin te yik izu neshir azǝ rɛ amkpa waŋ ndi amene yime! <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Izhu Arik inǝk vli; mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ neshir ba nek iki nuŋ ba. Ilɛ keŋ ndi lɛ zhin ai Izhu ndi inǝk ivli. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Neme anuŋ ne miŋ min ba ne tanyɛmɛ ne lɛ muŋ ba.&gt;&gt; Yesɔ ne mǝne zhi ne kuti ai ŋɔwa ne miŋ men ba ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɔu ba te na zhi ai ŋɔwa ate baŋ wa alɛb abɛ te zor ben abɔu. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Yesɔ ne na di ba, &lt;&lt;Waŋ ai iki yiŋ ndi mne bla zhin ba nuŋ atei nyɛ ben abɛm ba se Tetɛɛ ne duŋu anyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Ire mkpaŋ yuŋɔ anuŋ abɛ zǝ Yesɔ tsen anuŋ ne duŋǝ ba ne na zeu ba.<verse eid="JHN 6:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Yesɔ arib abɛ na ndum amaa awur ane yaa te di, &lt;&lt;Izhin wɔb te zhin bǝ duŋ me, minyii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Siman Biturus atanyeu ma te di, &lt;&lt;Arik, ta tei gar ben iŋɔwai? Uyi ne ivli kɛ yaŋ klɛtu. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Tane tanyɛmɛ te zhi te uyi tsetser ndi are ben Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Ankyak Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Bai nga ne hria zhin, awur ane yaa kai? ama izhin ne miŋ min ai shetan!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />(Adi Yahuda skariyoti izu siman, waŋ ndi, ne yi ne miŋ kɛ awur ane yaa, ai wa atei baŋ Yesɔ alɛb.)<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ben amun zumen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Ndi yiŋ ne gayir, Yesɔ ne tsin agɔŋ ari ntun yi Galili, ne kyak gar Yahudiya te Yahudawa awɔbu ne ŋunu. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Ama ndi igyaŋ ye bur yi Yahudawa ne te gbahir. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Amunzumen ne Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Duŋ yaŋa te gar Yahudiya, te abɛ zeu tsin abɛ yik iki yi vuŋ anu ndi unai. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Iwaŋ ndi awɔb te aneshir abɛ zhiu ba na kiki asuyir ba. Ndi u na kiki yiŋɛ, tsar gɔnmimi itu mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Te ire kukub amunzumene ba ne tanyɛmɛ ben abɔu ba.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Neme Yesɔ ne bla ba te di, &lt;&lt;Mkpaŋ muŋ ba ne zen nyɛ ba; ama izhineba kɔte kpaŋ takɛ yi anenen bene bɛ zhin. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Igɔnmimi ba te kyak zhin ba, ama ne kyak me tem bla ba te di iki yi na men yi mimin. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Izhineba bǝ tsen gar zhin igyaŋa. Nga bam gar igyaŋa azizaŋa ba, te mkpaŋ muŋ bane zen nyɛ ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Ndi ne bla ba amɛ ne sɔŋ ne Galili.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Neme, ndi amunzumen ne Yesɔ ne kɔmɔ ne igyaŋa, Yesɔ ne gar mayi, ba ne zhi ner nuŋ ba. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Ne amkpa ne igyaŋa Yahudawa ne zen wɔb bu te rib te di, &lt;&lt;Ayi ne me?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Ne miŋ ntsan aneshir ne amkpa ne igyaŋa ne zen lɛ raraŋ ne atu ye Yesɔ. Anuŋ adi, &lt;&lt;Ai neshir didik.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:12">Anuŋ adi, &lt;&lt;ba yi amɛ ba, alɔm aneshir.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Ama ba nuŋ ne ru aklɛ te lɛ ndende ba te ate sisik Yahudawa.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne tsar ne amkpa ne gyaŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Ndi igyaŋa ne gab atsutsu Yesɔ ne lu kli ne miŋ Akabakɔŋ te zen tsar. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Yahudawa ne vuŋ anu te rib te di, &lt;&lt;Iner waŋa ne na kikin te zhi iki ngɔŋ amɛ te ba ne gar aki aye tsar ka?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Itsar muŋ ba yi muŋ ba. Ire ben Arik waŋ ndi ne shar me. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Iwaŋ ndi te na iki yiŋ ndi Arik awɔb yi, atei zhi te itsar muŋ ire ben Arik ka me lǝlɛ kɛ tu muŋ. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Abaŋ ndi alɛ ne atu maa awɔb te bǝ nǝgu ngɔŋ, ama iwaŋ ndi ana ndum kɛ waŋ ndi ne sharu abɛ nǝgu ngɔŋ ai ner didik; ba timu ba. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Ba Musa ne cɛr zhin ilɛ keŋ ndi Arik ne nǝgu ka? Neme ba nuŋ ne miŋ min ndi ne zǝ kɛ. Ai yi duŋ zhin wɔb ŋun me?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Ntsan aneshire adiu, &lt;&lt;Uyi ne anerim,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Iŋɔwa awɔb ŋunu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Mna iki zhiin yi vuŋ anu ankyak, fe bɔbɔk mine sak aŋɔk ne anu. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Neme, te Musa ne duŋ zhin kɔkzik amumun (ba ne rɛ ben Musa ba, ne rɛ ben atsintsim amin), izhin kɔk vǝvǝn lum zǝk ne bɛr yi sɔŋ sik. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Neme ate yi ndi atei kɔk vǝvǝn lum zik ne bɛr yi sɔŋ sik te bǝ zǝ cɛr yi Musa, te anii ne duŋ izhin tǝ mfu ben abɛm ndi mne duŋ neshir are bɔbɔk ne bar sɔŋ sik? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Izhin bǝ duŋ te neshir ambuk ne yik ayi ankyak, te te zhin ambuk anenen.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ wa ayi Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Ne mkpaŋa aneshir anuŋ ne Urshelima arib te di, &lt;&lt;Ba waŋa ai neshir ndi azǝn wɔb te bǝ tsǝgu aŋun ka? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Tɔ waŋ me, azǝn lɛ ndende, ama ba ne diu ikinuŋ ba. Ka angɔŋgɔŋ ne ka tanyɛmɛ te iwa ayi Kristi me didik ni? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Ta ne zhi amkpa waŋ ndi ner waŋa areme; ama Yesɔ atei nyɛ ba nuŋ atei zhi amkpa waŋ ndi areme ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Fe ndi Yesɔ, ne nak azǝn tsar ne Akabakɔŋ, ankyak alǝk kɔr tedi, &lt;&lt;Iyi amɛ, izhin ne zhim, izhin ne na zhi amkpa waŋ ndi mreme. Bam ne nyɛ yaŋa ne tu muŋ ba, ama waŋ ndi ne shar me ai nǝ bla lɛ didik. Ba zhin ne zhiu ba, <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />ama nga mne zhiu te mrɛ bǝn abɔu ai wa ne shar me.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Neme ne wɔb te aba abɛ vuŋu, ama inuŋ bane ne cogu ŋɔk ba, te mkpaŋ maa ba ne zen te ba. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Neme, aneshir tetɛk ne miŋ kɛ tsǝn aneshir ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn Yesɔ. Adi, &lt;&lt;Kristi me ate nyɛ, atei na iki vuŋ anu anaŋ iner waŋai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Ferisawa ne wɔ ntsan aneshir zen lǝlɛ raraŋ ne tu kɛ Yesɔ. Ankyak ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik bǝn Ferisawa ashar abɛ blɛ Akabakɔŋ abɛ kɔte vuŋu.<verse eid="JHN 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Myi ben abɛ zhin ne mkpaŋ watsɔb, ankyak M tei kam kɔmɔ ben waŋ ndi ne shar me. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Izhin tei wɔb me, ama ba zhin tei yik me ba; amkpa waŋ ndi mgara, ba zhin tei ya nyɛmɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Yahudawa adi akpa men, &lt;&lt;Iner waŋa atei kɔmɔ ne amɛ te di ta te wɔb wa lakɛne? Atei gar amkpa waŋ ndi aneshir amɔr ne gar ne miŋ kɛ abaŋ ndi bai ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba, te tsar abaŋ ndi bai Yahudawa ba? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Iner waŋ adi anii ndi adi, &lt;Izhin te wɔb me, ama ba zhin te yik me ba,&gt;bǝn &lt;amkpa awaŋ ndi m yime, ba zhin te ya nyɛ ba&gt;?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amashir ane nek ivli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Ne bɛr klɛ ben iber ngɔŋ yi igyaŋa, Yesɔ ne lu kli te lɛ ne kɔr ngɔŋ, iwaŋ ndi ihre te vuŋu, abɛ nyɛ ben abɛm te so. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Iwaŋ ndi ate tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɛm, ndi ne cɛr, angyak atuk amashir ane nek vli atei gbub ne miŋ maa.&gt;&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Yesɔ ne bla yiŋɛ ne lɛ kɛ Izhu tsetser, abaŋ ndi ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɔu atei ta. Ne mkpaŋ yuŋɔ bane zen anek ba Izhu tsetser ba, te bane zen lek Yesɔ te negu ngɔŋ maa ba.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aneshir ne ŋar akpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Ndi ne wɔ lɛ maa, aneshir anuŋ adi, Le didik iner waŋa ai ine bla shar yi Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Anuŋ adi, &lt;&lt;Ai Kristi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Ama anuŋ ne rib te di, Kristi bate rurɛ Galili ba <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Ne cɛr te di Kristi atei rɛ nga ŋli kɛ Doda ne Batalami, ntun yiŋ ndi Doda ayimei?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Fe ntsan aneshir ne ŋar akpa ne atu ye Yesɔ. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Anuŋ wɔb te aba bǝ vuŋu ama ba nuŋ ne cogu ŋɔk ba.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ Yahudawa ba ne tanyɛme ben Yesɔ ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Ankyak abɛ blɛ Akabakɔŋ akama gar bǝn ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik ben Ferisawa, arib ba te di, ayi nii duŋ zhin gliu te nyɛ ayaŋa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Abɛ blɛ Akabaŋkɔŋ ŋɔ adi, &lt;&lt;inuŋ bane zǝn lɛ ndi iner waŋa ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Ferisawa adi abɛ blɛm te di, &lt;&lt;izhin di ne cɔk zhin iminyi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />&lt;&lt;kɔ inuŋ ne miŋ kɛ angɔŋgɔŋ bǝn Ferisawa ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɔu? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Ba yeme ba, Ama ibiŋ aneshir ndi ba ne zhi iki nuŋ ne cɛr yi Musa ba, Arik atei ti zhin ambuk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Nikɔdimu, waŋ ndi ne gar ben Yesɔ kukub ndi ne na yi ne miŋ men, arib, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />&lt;&lt;Ilɛ kɛ cɛr yi Musa ne di batei te aneshir ambuk ndi ba ne wɔ iki nuŋ ne anu maa te zhi ana anii kai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Mtanyɛmɛ te di, uwa ure Galili, miyii? Ubǝ tɔ te yik, utǝ yik ine bla shar yi Arik ba te rurɛ miŋ Galili ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Fe kɔte ŋɔ a kɔmɔ ne kɔb maa.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Ne vuŋ iwa nuŋ ne kur ben lulum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Ankyak kɔte ŋɔwa akɔmɔ ne kɔb maa, ama Yesɔ ne gar Igbu iyi tiŋ zetun. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Nǝ amblimblɛ ane ku zǝ Yesɔ ne yir miŋ Akabakɔŋ, aneshir bɔbɔk ne kamu azǝk, fe ne zǝ sɔŋ te zen tsar ba. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Abɛ tsar cɛr yi Musa bǝn Ferisawa ne gli iwa nuŋ ndi ne vuŋu ne kur bǝn lulum nuŋ. Ne duŋu aklɛ ne atsutsu amen bɔbɔk. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Te di Yesɔ, &lt;&lt;Ine tsar, ne vuŋ iwa waŋa akɔkur bǝn lulum nuŋ. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Icɛr yi Musa ne bla te tabǝ tyak ir iwa waŋa aŋun ne mkpaŋ. Azizaŋa uwa udi kiki nǝ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Ne rib lɛ kǝŋe te bɛ ten Yesɔ, te aba abɛ yik iki vuŋu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:6">Ama Yesɔ a zedɔ te cɛr ne mimi ne vǝn ŋɔk maa. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Ndi ne zen kyak te rib bu lǝlɛ, alu aklɛ tedi ba, &lt;&lt;Waŋ ndi ba ne taba na zumimin ba, abɛ kuti atyagu ne mkpaŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Yesɔ nena zedɔ te cɛr ne mimi.<verse eid="JHN 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Ndi ne wɔ amɛ ne kama tibɛ azhizhiin, vuŋre bǝn ngɔŋ amene, ne duŋ Yesɔ wa kiki maa, ben iwama aklikla ne amkpama. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yesɔ alu aklɛ adidik te rib iwama te di, &lt;&lt;Iwa, aneshire ayi ne me? Ba nuŋ ne teu ambuk kai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Iwama adi Yesɔ, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, ba nuŋ,&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Nga muŋ yi bam ne nǝgu lalɛ ba, kɔmɔ kǝr ubena zumimiŋ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ wa ayi ilu kɛ laŋ kɛ gɔŋmimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yesɔ nena lɛ bǝn Ferisawa te di, &lt;&lt;Nga Myi lu kɛ laŋ ne gɔnmimi. Iwaŋ ndi ate zǝm batei tsen ne bu ba, ama atei yi ne lu kɛ vli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Ferisawa adiu, &lt;&lt;Azizaŋa ulɛ ilɛ kɛ tu mi; iki yi bla mi ba iyi didik ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesɔ asaga te di, &lt;&lt;kɔ ate yi ndi mbla lɛ ne atu amuŋ, iki yiŋ ndi Mblaima ai lɛ didik, te Mne zhi amkpa awaŋ ndi Mreme ben amkpa awaŋ ndi Mgara. Ba zhin ne zhi amkpa awaŋ ndi Mreme ben amkpa waŋ ndi Mgaru ba. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Izhin te ambuk ne yik ayi ir kɛ neshir; Nga bam ne te nuŋ ambuk ba. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Ama atei ndi Mte ambuk, ambuk amuŋ ayi izub, te bam yi kiki muŋ ba. Tetɛɛ muŋ ndi ne shar me ayi bǝn abɛm. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Nǝ cɛr ne lɛ kɛ kpa nyak min te di ilɛ ne anu aneshire ayaa ai lɛ didik. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Mbla lɛ ne atu muŋ, Tetɛɛ muŋ waŋ ndi ne shar me ne na bla lɛ ne atu muŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Ankyak aribu te di, &lt;&lt;Tetɛɛ mi ayi ne mei?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Ba zhin ne zhim ba ben Tetɛɛ muŋ ba, abɛ di izhin ne zhim izhin bǝ na zhi Tetɛɛ amuŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesɔ ne bla lǝlɛ yiŋɛ bɔbɔk ndi ne tsar ne akabakɔŋ ane amkpa waŋ ndi abu ane shur azɔb ayime. Neme inuŋ ba ne vuŋu ba, te mkpaŋ maa ba ne zen te ba.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yesɔ ne na di ba, &lt;&lt;M tei ngar tsǝn, izhin tei wɔb me, ama izhin tei ku ne lalɛ min. Amkpa awaŋ ndi Mgaru, ba zhin tei garu iyir ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Neme, iduŋ angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ Yahudawa arib te di, &lt;&lt;Atei ŋun tu mai? Ayi iyiŋɛ yi duŋu adi, Amkpa waŋ ndi me gar ba zhin tei garu iyir ba?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Izhineba yi abɛ gɔnmimi kǝŋe; Nga Mrɛ shu. Izhineba yi abɛ gɔnmimi kǝŋe, ama Nga bam rɛ gɔnmimi kǝŋe ba. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Waŋa ayi ki yiŋ ndi mbla zhin te izhin tei ku ne zumimin min; atei ndi izhin te kyak tanyɛmɛ tedi Nga myi waŋ ndi mǝne blaa zhin ne kuti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Aribu tedi, &lt;&lt;Uyi ŋɔwai?&gt;&gt; Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Ir keŋ ndi Mne men bla zhin ne kuti. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Me yi ne kiki tetɛk yi bla ne atu amin, te na te zhin ambuk. Iwaŋ ndi ne shar me ayi ne na didik, neme iki yiŋ ndi mne wɔi bǝn abɔu ai yi mbla gɔnmimi ne yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Bane zhi te Yesɔ alɛ ne atu yi Tetɛɛ maa ba. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Ankyak Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Izhin te lɛk Izu Neshir igli ne shu, izhin teshe zhi te &lt;Nga Myi Nga;&gt; neme izhin teshe zhi te bam na ikiki yiŋɛ ne mgbyamgbyaŋ muŋ ba, ama mnak bla iki yiŋ ndi Tetɛɛ ne di mblai. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Tetɛɛ waŋ ndi ne shar me ayi ben abɛm; ba ne duŋ me kiki muŋ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Aneshir tetɛk ndi ne wɔ lɛ kɛ Yesɔ ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɔu.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ina didik min itei ta zhin shur</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Yesɔ ne di Yahudawa abaŋ ndi ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɔu te di, &lt;&lt;Izhin te zǝ ilɛ muŋ izhin yi abɛ zǝm tsen abe zub; <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Izhin tei zhi lɛ didik, lɛ didik min kɛ te ta zhin shur.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Adiu, &lt;&lt;Tayi nŋli kɛ Ibrai ba ta ne na agen ne amkpa nuŋ ba. Te anii duŋǝ di atei ta ta shur?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Mbla zhin lɛ didik, iwaŋ ndi te na zumimin ayi igen kɛ zumimin. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Igen ba yi nŋli kɛ kɔbɔ ba, ama ivǝn ne kɔb ayi ne kɔbɔ gar klɛtu. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Atei yi ndi Izu Arik ate tau zhɔk, fe une yik ta zhɔk anenen. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Mne zhi te izhin yi ŋli kɛ Ibrai. Ama izhin wɔb ŋun me, te ba zhin ne ta tsar muŋ ba. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Me bla iki yiŋ ndi Tetɛɛ amuŋ ne tsar me neyi, ama izhineba na iki yiŋ ndi tetɛɛ min ne bla zhin ne yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Adiu, &lt;&lt;Tetɛɛ mɔr ai Ibrai.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Yesɔ adi ba,&lt;&lt; Abɛ di zhin yi amumun Ibrai, izhin bǝ na iki yiŋ ndi ne nai. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Bɔbɔk iki yiŋ ndi mǝne nai mne bla zhin lɛ didik keŋ ndi mǝne wɔ kɛ rɛ ben Arik, neme izhin ne wɔb ŋun me. Ibrai bane na ikinuŋ amɛ ba! <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Izhin na iki yiŋ ndi tetɛɛ min ne nai.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">&lt;&lt;Arik wa ankyak ayi Tetɛɛ waŋ ndi ne tanyɛmɛ ne wu,&gt;&gt;fe adi, &lt;&lt;taba mɔr yi tayi amumuen amaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amumun abɛ shetan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Abɛ di Arik ayi Tetɛɛ min, izhin bǝ nyeru, te mrɛ ben Arik fe azizaŋa me yi ne yaŋa. Bam ne nyɛ ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ tu muŋ ba, ama ai Arik wa ne shar me. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Aye nii duŋ zhin ba zhi iki yiŋ ndi blai ka? Tǝ zhin ba wɔ iki yiŋ ndi me blai ba. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Izhin yi amumuen abɛ tetɛɛ min, shetan, izhin wɔb te zhin bǝ na iki yiŋ ndi tetɛɛ min wɔ bɛ. Ne kuti ne yi ne ŋlɔk aneshir bane yi ne na zub ba, te izub ba yi ne miŋ maa ba. Te timu, ana iki yiŋ ndi irɛ kpa maa, te ayi ne timu ana yi tetɛɛ abe timu. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Ama mbla zhin lɛ didik, waŋa ayi ki yiŋ ndi ne kyak tanyɛmɛ bɛn abɛm. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Iŋɔwa ne miŋ min atei tsar me zumimin yi na muŋ? ate yi ndi mbla zhin lɛ didik te aye nii iduŋ zhin kyak tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɛm? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Iwaŋ ndi ayi bǝn Arik awɔ iki yiŋ ndi mblai. Ba zhin yi abɛ Arik ba waŋ ayi ki yiŋ ndi ba zhin wɔu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ben Ibrai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Yahudawa arib Yesɔ te di, &lt;&lt;Bata ne bla lɛ didik ka ndi ta di uyi awɔ ne Samariya te na yi ne anerim?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />&lt;&lt;Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Bam yi ne anerim ba, me nek Tetɛɛ amuŋ ngɔŋ maa, ama izhineba kyak me. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Bam wɔb nek tu muŋ ngɔŋ ba; ama inuŋ ayime ndi awɔb ne kɛ, ai wa ayi ne te ambuk. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Mbla zhin lɛ didik: Waŋ ndi atei zǝ lɛ muŋ batei ku ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Yahudawa adiu, &lt;&lt;Azizaŋa ta ne zhi te uyi ne anerim! Ibrai ne ku, abɛ bla shar yi Arik ne na ku, fe uwa udi uwaŋ ndi ate zǝ lɛ mi batei ku ba. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Tetɛɛ mɔr Ibrai ne ku; uwa bau naŋu ba, ka u naŋu nii? Abɛ bla shar yi Arik ne ku. uwa uyik te di uyi ŋɔwai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesɔ adi ba, ate yi ndi me nek tu muŋ ngɔŋ bai iki nuŋ ba. Iwaŋ ndi anem ngɔŋ ayi Tetɛɛ amuŋ, iwaŋ ndi izhin idi wa ayi Arik amin. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Ba zhin ne zhiu ba, ama nga mne zhiu. Abɛ di mne di bam ne zhiu ba, mbǝ yi ne ti mu ndi zhine ba. Ama mne zhiu, te na zǝ ilɛ maa. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Tetɛɛ min Ibrai ne nyɛr te wa bǝ yik mkpaŋ kɛ nyɛ mu; ne yik kɛ tena nyɛr.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Yahudawa adiu, &lt;&lt;Bau ne mla ase sɔktuŋ ba, fe udi une yik Ibrai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Mbla zhin lɛ didik, ne kuti yime te ne shi ŋli Ibrai.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Neme, ne vu mkpaŋ te ba bǝ tyagu, ama Yesɔ ne suyir te ru ne Akabakɔŋ.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne na ner waŋ ndi ne ŋliu amfik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Ndi Yesɔ ne tsǝtsen kiki maa, ne yik ner nuŋ waŋ ndi ne ŋliu amfik. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Abɛ tsene maa aribu te di, &lt;&lt;Ne tsar, ai zumimin yi ŋɔwa ne duŋ ner waŋa ne yi amfik? ai wa ka ayi abɛ ŋliu maa ini?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesɔ adi ba, iku amfik maa bai zumimin maa kɔ tetɛɛ maa kɔ iyah maa ba. Ayi amfik te Arik abɛ tsar mgbyamgbyaŋ maa ne tu maa. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Ta bǝ na ndum kɛ iwaŋ ndi ne shar me ndi arik anak ri laŋ, ibu tei te ndi ba nuŋ atei ya na ndum ba. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Ndi me nak ri yi ne gɔnmimi, me yi lu kɛ laŋ ne gɔnmimi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Nǝ bla yiŋɛ, Yesɔ ne ruk ante shur ne mimi, te cɔk mimi ne ante maa te kin ne ayi ner ne amfik ge <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />te diu, &lt;&lt;kɔte ŋla ti mi ne nkam amashir ne silɔm.&gt;&gt; (ndi ai &lt;&lt;ne shar.&gt;&gt;) ankyak nɛrɛ agar te kɔte ŋla ti maa te kam aŋyak ne bu ayi.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Abɛ sɔŋ yaŋu, ben abaŋ ndi ne bene ayigu azǝn ben arib te di, ba waŋa aneshir waŋ ndi akɔsɔŋ te ben kai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Anuŋ adi, &lt;&lt;Ai wa,&gt;&gt; ama anuŋ adi, &lt;&lt;Ba ai wa ba; ne nak ruu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Ankyak iner ndi ne ben yi amfik adi ba, &lt;&lt;Ai nga Me yi wa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Aribu te di, &lt;&lt;Tǝ u na kikin te yik amkpa azizaŋai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Atanyeme te di, &lt;&lt;Iner waŋ ndi azhɔu te Yesɔ ne cɔk mimi ne ante maa te kin me ne yi, te di me kɔte ŋla ti muŋ ne nkam amashir ane silɔm, ankyak me kɔte ŋla ti muŋ, fe ayi amuŋ akɔ bu ankyak mku yik amkpa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Arib te di, &lt;&lt;Tǝ ayi ne mei?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Adi, &lt;&lt;Bam ne zhi ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ferisawa ne wɔb zhi lɛ kɛ na iner waŋ ndi ne yi amfik ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Ankyak aneshire ne Gli iner waŋ ndi ne yi amfik ge te gar ben Ferisawa. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Ibɛr yiŋ ndi Yesɔ ne cɔk ante ne mimi te kin ner ne amfik ge te duŋu areme ai ibɛr yi sɔŋ sik. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Neme Ferisawa ne na rib bu ir keŋ ndi ayi amaa ne bumɔ. Adi ba, &lt;&lt;Ne kin me mimi ne ayi amuŋ, ankyak mne ŋlai fe mku yik amkpa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Anuŋ ne miŋ kɛ Ferisawa ma adi, &lt;&lt;Iner waŋ ndi ne na iki yiŋɛ batei rɛ bǝn Arik ba, te ba ze ibɛr yi sɔŋ sik ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Fe Ferisawa ma ana rib bu te di, &lt;&lt;Udi iner waŋa ne bu ayi ami, utei di anii ne atu maa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Iner waŋ ndi ne yi amfik ge adi ba, &lt;&lt;Ai ine bla shar yi Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Yahudawa ba ne tanyɛmɛ te iner waŋa ne men ayi ne amfik te ayik azizaŋa ba, se ndi ne zhɔ abɛ ŋliu ma ne liŋ <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />te rib ba te di, iner waŋa ayi vǝvǝn min yi? Izhin di ne ŋliu amfik; te ana kikin te ayik azizaŋa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Tetɛɛ maa ben iyah amaa adi, &lt;&lt;Ta ne zhi te ayi vǝvǝn mɔr, te na zhi te na ŋliu ne amfik. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Ama ba ta ne zhi ir keŋ ndi ne na te ayik azizaŋa ba, ba ta ne zhi iwaŋ ndi ne duŋu ayik amkpa ba. Tɔ zhin waŋ te ribbu, ai ne mla ne lɛ ne tu maa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Abɛ ŋliu ma adi amɛ te aklu sisik Yahudawa, te Yahudawa ne men akpa aŋyak te di iwaŋ ndi ate tanyɛme te di Yesɔ neyi Kristi atei tunu agli arumɔ ne Akabaŋkɔŋ. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Waŋa ayi iki yiŋ ndi abɛ ŋliu ne di, &lt;&lt;Nǝ mla ne lɛ; abɛ rib bu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Mkpaŋ kɛ yaa atara zhɔ iner waŋ ndi ne yi amfik ge, te diu, &lt;&lt;Bǝ tanyɛmɛ bǝn Arik utei bla ta lɛ didik! Ta ne zhi te iner waŋa ayi ne na zumimin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Adi ba, &lt;&lt;Ka iner waŋa ayi ne na zumimin ka ba yi ne na zumimin ba, bam ne zhi ba. Mne yi amfik, ama azizaŋa myik amkpa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Aribu te di, &lt;&lt;Ne anau anii? Nǝ ana kikin te bu ayi amie?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Adi ba, &lt;&lt;Mneka men bla zhin ba zhin ne wɔ ba. Izhin na wɔb te izhin bǝ wɔ anii? Izhin wɔb te izhin bǝ zeu min yi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Ankyak angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ Yahudawa ma akɔ yenu tuk te di, &lt;&lt;Uwa uyi ne zeu; ama taba yi abɛ Musa. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Tane zhi te Arik ne lɛ ben Musa, ama tei ner waŋa, ba ta ne zhi amkpa awaŋ ndi areme ba!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Inere adi, &lt;&lt;Waŋa ayi ki yi vuŋ anu! Ba zhin ne zhi amkpa waŋ ndi areme ba, ama ne bu ayi amuŋ. <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Ta ne zhi te Arik ba wɔ abɛ na zumimin ba; awɔ aner abaŋ ndi anegu ngɔŋ te na iki yiŋ ndi awɔb te abɛ nai. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Ne kuti yi gɔnmimi ba nuŋ ne azen awɔ te iner nuŋ abu abɛ amfik ayi ba. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Abɛ di ner waŋa ba rɛ ben Arik ba, bai abɛ na ikinuŋ amɛ ba.<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Nǝ yiŋɛ aneshire adi, &lt;&lt;Ne ŋliu ne zumimin nena te ngɔŋ ne zumimin; fe utak wɔb te ubǝ tsar tei!&gt;&gt; Akyak akɔ yaru agli aru ne Akabaŋkɔŋ ŋɔ.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amfik ayi Izhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Ndi Yesɔ ne wɔ ne Gli ner waŋa agli aru ne Akabakɔŋ ŋɔ, awɔb neshire te rib bu te di, &lt;&lt;Une tanyɛmɛ bǝn Izu Neshir yi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Inere adi, &lt;&lt;Blam ayi ŋɔwa ayi Izu Neshire, Ngɔŋ, te duŋ me tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɔu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Une ka yigu; ai wa aklɛ lɛ ben abɔu azizaŋa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Ankyak inere adi, Ngɔŋ, mne tanyɛmɛ,&gt;&gt; Fe akɔ tar agbarum ne ti kɛ Yesɔ te zǝ kuu.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Mne nyɛ gɔnmimi kǝŋe te mte ambuk, te abɛ amfik abɛ yik amkpa abaŋ ndi ayik abɛ yi amfik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Ferisawa anuŋ ndi ne yi bǝn abɔu ne wɔu abla lɛ kǝŋe te rib bu te di, &lt;&lt;Fe udi ta yi amfik, mɔryii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Abɛ di izhin ne yi amfik, ba zhin bǝ yi abɛ na zumimin ba; ama izhin di izhin yik, izhin yi abɛ na zumimin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Nkan lɛ ne atu ner ne kiu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Mbla zhin lɛ didik: iner waŋ ndi bate zǝ anɔkɔŋ azhin akɛ awanta ayir ba, ama ate zǝ amkpa nuŋ ayir ne mgbyamgbyaŋ, ai nɛr ne zhib ben ne ŋub aneshir ne ankɔŋ te ta iki men ne mgbyamgbyaŋ. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Iner waŋ ndi azǝ anɔkɔŋ ayir wa ayi akiki ane awanta ma. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Iner ne blɛmɛ abuu anɔkɔŋ, ankyak awanta ma awɔ kɔr maa. Azho awanta amaa ne asak amen te Gli ba te ru. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Ndi te gli ba ru bɔbɔk, akuti mǝne, awanta ma azeu te ne zhi kɔr maa. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Ama ba tei zǝ icen ba; neme, atei klu akam atibe ben ner yuŋɔ te bane zhi ikɔr maa ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesɔ ne bla ba nkan lɛ yiŋɛ, ama ba ne zhi iki yiŋ ndi abla ba neyi ba.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne kiu didik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Fe Yesɔ ana di, &lt;&lt;Mbla zhin lɛ didik, me yi anɔkɔŋ akɛ zǝ awanta. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Bɔbɔk abaŋ ndi ne kuti anyɛm ayi abɛ ŋub aneshir ne nkunkɔŋ te ta kiki men ne mgbyamgbyaŋ, ama awanta maa ba ne wɔ ba ba. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Nga Me yi anɔkɔŋ; iwaŋ ndi ate zǝ bǝn abɛm atei yik ita zhɔk. Atei yir te na ru, te yik isik. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Ine zhib anak nyɛ te wa abɛ zhib te na ŋun te na cɔk ala. Ama nga mne nyɛ te abɛ yik ivli, te bɛ yik ivli kɛ yaŋ klɛtu tetɛk.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />&lt;&lt;Myi ne kiu didik, waŋ ndi anǝk susun maa ne atu yi Awanta. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Iwaŋ ndi akyu te abɛ yau, ba yi akiki ne awanta ma ba, te yik Ici anyɛ, aklu kama tibɛ te duŋ awanta ma; fe ici anyɛ vu awanta ma te ŋar ba ate ten. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Inere aklu akam atibe te ne baŋu kiu te yau ikinuŋ ba lɛnu susun ne atu yi awanta ma ba.<verse eid="JHN 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14-15" />&lt;&lt;Me yi ne kiu didik.Irkǝŋ ndi Tetɛɛ ne zhim me nena zhi Tetɛɛ amuŋ, nemɛ mne zhi awanta muŋ ne na zhim. Mne nek tu muŋ te mbǝ nku ne atu amen te abɛ yik ivli. <verse eid="JHN 10:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Myi ne awanta anuŋ ndi ba yi ne ntsan kǝŋe ba. M tei ngli ba nyaga menyi. Aba menyi atei wɔ kɔr muŋ, atei yi ntsan zhiin bǝn ne kiu zhiin. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />&lt;&lt;Iki yiŋ ndi Tetɛɛ a nyɛr me, Mne tanyɛme te mbǝ nek susun muŋ, te mbǝ na nta kɛ yaŋa. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Inuŋ ba atei baŋ ivli muŋ ba, ama Mne nek kɛ ne tanyɛmɛ muŋ. Myi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ nek ivli te na nta kǝ yaŋa. Mne ta lɛ kɛ nek kǝŋe bǝn Tetɛɛ muŋ. <verse eid="JHN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Ilɛ kǝŋe ne ŋar Yahudawa. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Tetɛk ne miŋ kɛ Yahudawa ma ne di, &lt;&lt;Ayi ne anerim! Ana landar! Izhin wɔu te nii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Ama anuŋ adi, &lt;&lt;Iner ne yi ne anerim ba tei lɛ amɛ ba! Iner ne yi ne anerim atei ya bu ner ne amfik ayi?<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yahudawa ne kyak tanyɛme ben Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Nǝ mkpaŋ kɛ mvlu, Yahudawa ne na igyaŋ yi nek Arik Akabakɔŋ ne Urshelima. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yesɔ ne zen tsen ne ti kɛ Akabakɔŋ ayou Solɔmɔn. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Yahudawa ne kamu azik te rib bu te di, &lt;&lt;Utǝ baŋ mkpaŋ tetɛk te duŋ ta yaŋ tanyɛme ne susun amɔr? Ate yi ndi iwa uyi Kristi me, ru kli te bla ta.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Mne nka mbla zhin, ama izhin ne kyak tanyɛme. Ikiki yi vuŋ anu ndi mne nai ne sak kɛ Tetɛɛ amuŋ ne lɛ ne atu amuŋ, <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />ama ba izhin ne tanyɛmɛ ba te zhin ba yi ne miŋ kɛ ntsan awanta amuŋ ba. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Awanta amuŋ awɔ kɔr muŋ; Mne zhi ba, ana zǝm. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Mnǝk ba ivli kɛ yaŋ klɛtu, ba atei na ku ba; ba nuŋ atei kyer ba ata ne aŋɔk amuŋ ba. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Tetɛɛ muŋ, waŋ ndi ne nǝm ne ba anaŋ kiki bɔbɔk; ba nuŋ atei ya kyer ba ta ne aŋɔk Tetɛɛ amuŋ ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Tetɛɛ ben nga ta yi zhiin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Ankyak Yahudawa avu mkpaŋ te aba bǝ tyak gu, <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />ama Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Mne ntsar zhin kiki yi vuŋ anu tetɛk ndi rɛ bǝn Tetɛɛ muŋ. Ai tayi tǝ izhin wɔb tyak me ne atu amaa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Yahudawa adi, &lt;&lt;Bata wɔb te ta bǝ tyagu ne atu yi iki didik izhiin ndi une nai ba,ama ne atu yi cɔk sak kɛ Arik la! Uyi neshir ama ubaŋ tumi ndi Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Ne cɛr ne icɛr yi kpa nyak min te di, &lt;&lt;Izhin yi ane arik?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Ta ne zhi te ilɛ kɛ Arik idi; Arik azho aneshir ayuŋɔ te ane arik, abaŋ ndi ne nek ba ilɛ me. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Atei nga, Tetɛɛ ne hriam tena shar me ne gɔnmimi. Fe, aye nii, te zhin di mne cɔk sak kɛ Arik la ndi mne ndi myi Izu Arik? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Ba zhin ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɛm ba, se ndi mne na iki yiŋ ndi Tetɛɛ amuŋ ne di aneyi. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Ama M tei nai, neme ba zhin ne tanyɛmɛ ben abɛm ba, izhin bǝ tanyɛmɛ ne iki yi vuŋ anu ndi mne nai, te izhin bǝ zhi te Tetɛɛ ayi ben abɛm, nga nayi ben abɔu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Ne me nena wɔb te aba abɛ vuŋ Yesɔ, ama ne ru anaŋ adɔ ben abɛba.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Fe Yesɔ ne kama glɔ inǝk ne Urdu ne amkpa awaŋ ndi Yɔɔna ne su aneshir ne sak kɛ Arik, ne asɔŋ amɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Aneshir tetɛk ne nyɛ ben abɔu, adi&lt;&lt;Yɔɔna ba ne na iki yi vuŋ anu ba, ama bɔbɔk iki yiŋ ndi Yɔɔna ne blai ne atu yi ner waŋa ai lɛ didik. <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Ne muɔ aner tetɛk ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn Yesɔ.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Iku Lazaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Neme iner nuŋ ndi azhɔu te Lazaru, ne lɔ, ndi ayi ne ntun yi Batanya, ntun anǝ Meryamu bǝn iva men Marta. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Meryamu waŋa ai wa ane shur Yesɔ anyɛ ne yemgbo didik ne aza te kinu ne fumfuk tu maa, ai zumen Lazaru ne lɔ. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Amunvamene ne ashar te abɛ kɔte bla Yesɔ te di, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, iwaŋ ndi unyeru ma alɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Ndi Yesɔ ne wɔ amɛ, adi, &lt;&lt;Iklɛtu yi ilɔ yiŋɛ ba tei yi ku kɛ Lazaru ba, iki yiŋɛ ina te abɛ nek Arik ngɔŋ, itei na yi ankɔŋ awaŋ ndi Izu Neshir atei ta ngɔŋ maa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yesɔ anyer Marta bǝn iva men Meryamu bǝn Lazaru. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Fe ndi awɔ te Lazaru alɔ, ne klɛ ne amkpa awaŋ ndi ayime bɛr yaa.<verse eid="JHN 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Ankyak Yesɔ adi abɛ zeu tsin te di, &lt;&lt;Ta bǝ kam gar ntun yi Yahudiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Abɛ zeu tsǝne adi, &lt;&lt;Ine Tsar, ne mkpaŋ watsɔb ndi ne gayir, Yahudawa ne wɔb te aba abɛ tyagu ne mkpaŋ, fe u na di tabǝ na kam gar amɔ?<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Ndika iber zhiin yi amkpaŋ awur ane yaa ka? Iner waŋ ndi atsǝn aririk ba tara aza ba, te ayik ilaŋ amkpa yi gɔnmimi kǝŋe. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Ama atei tsin ne ibu atei tara aza, te amkpa ba laŋ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Ndi Yesɔ ne bla amɛ, abla ba tedi, &lt;&lt;Ikpa mɔr Lazaru akɔ kurna; ama mgar sǝu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Abɛ tsene maa adi, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, ate yi ndi akɔ kurna, atei kama sǝ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Yesɔ alɛ ilɛ kɛ ku Lazaru, ama aba yik tedi ayi kurna didik.<verse eid="JHN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Ankyak Yesɔ akɔ bla ilɛ mɛ agli aru bama te di, &lt;&lt;Lazaru ne ku, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />ama mne nyɛr ndi bam yi amɔ ba, te izhin bǝ tanyɛmɛ. Ta bǝ gar ben abɔu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Ankyak Tɔma (ndi azhɔu te atagwe) adi nki abɛ zǝ Yesɔ tsǝne, &lt;&lt;Ta bǝ zǝ ne Tsar gar amɔ, te tabǝ te ku bene abɔu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ wa ai lɛk aneshir ne ku te nek ba ivli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Ndi Yesɔ ne yir, ne yik neka ru Lazaru neka te iber nas ne bɛ me. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Batanya ilak maa bane mla igab yaa ibaŋ ire Urshelima ba, <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />fe Yahudawa tetɛk ne nyɛ tek ane Marta bǝn Meryamu ne iku zumen. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Ndi Marta ne wɔ te Yesɔ asɔŋ anyɛ, ne ru akɔ te mla ben abɔu ne ankɔŋ, ama Meryamu ne klɛ ne kɔb.<verse eid="JHN 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Marta adi Yesɔ, &lt;&lt;Abɛ di une menyi ayaŋa, izumɔr bai bɛ ku ba. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Ama Mne zhi kɔ azizaŋa Arik atei nǝgu kɔte nii ndi utǝ rib bu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Izumin atei na lu ne ivli maa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Marta adi, &lt;&lt;Mne zhi atei lu ne bɛr yi kla tu ndi atei lɛk aneshir ne bɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Nga wa Myi lu aneshir ne bɛ tena nek ivli. Waŋ ndi te tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɛm atei yi tsitsir, kɔ atei ndi ne ku; <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />abaŋ ndi ayi atsitsir tena tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɛm ba atei ku ba. Izhin ne tanyɛmɛi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />&lt;&lt;Iyi amɛ, Ŋgɔŋ,&gt;&gt; Marta adi Yesɔ, &lt;&lt;Mne tanyɛmɛ te ndi uyi Kristi, Izu Arik, iwaŋ ndi atei nyɛ ne gɔnmimi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Ankyak ndi Marta ne bla amɛ, akama kɔte zhɔ iva men Meryamu te lɛ ben abɔu raraŋ te di. &lt;&lt;Ine Tsar ayi yaŋa, ana zen rib bu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Ndi Meryamu ne wɔ amɛ, alu andanda te kɔte yigu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Neme Yesɔ ba ne zen ayir ntuno ba, anak ari yi ne amkpa waŋ ndi Marta ne mla bǝn abɔu ma. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Ndi Yahudawa abɛ ayi ben Meryamu ne kɔbɔ, te zen nek ilɛ kɛ vuŋ susun, ndi ne yigu alu andanda te ru, azeu, ayik te di Meryamu agar zhin ne bɛ.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Ndi Meryamu ne yir amkpa awaŋ ndi Yesɔ ayime, ndi ne yigu, azhaku ne aza maa te di, &lt;&lt;Nǝ Tsar, abɛ di une men yi ayaŋa, izumɔr bai bɛ ku ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Ndi Yesɔ ne yigu azhin, ane Yahudawa abaŋ ndi ne zǝ Meryamu anyɛ azhin menyi, susun maa ne lɛnu, Izhu tsetser ne shɔgu. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Izhin ne ruu ne amei?&gt;&gt; Adi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">&lt;&lt;Nyɛ tɔ, Ŋgon,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesɔ azhin.<verse eid="JHN 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Ankyak Yahudawa adi, &lt;&lt;Tɔ ir keŋ ndi anyer Lazaru dei!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Ama anuŋ ne miŋ mǝne adi, &lt;&lt;Bai waŋa ayi waŋ ndi ne bu ne amfik yuŋɔ ayi ka, te bai bɛ ana yar lazaru ne ku kai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne lɛk Lazaru ne bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Susun kɛ Yesɔ nena lɛnu ŋgon, agar bɛ me. Ibǝ me azhɔk mkpaŋ ndi ne subǝ te ku kɛ nǝ mkpaŋ ŋgon. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Ŋli zhin mkpaŋ yiŋɛ gli tibɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Ama Marta iva men ane Lazaru ndi ne kumɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Ikumɔ tei ye mgbɔ mimin ngɔŋ, te neka te bɛr nas ne miŋ bɛme.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Ankyak Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Bam ne Mbla zhin te di izhin te yik ngɔŋ kɛ Arik te zhin bǝ tanyɛmɛ kai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Fe akɔ ŋli mkpaŋa agli atibe. Ankyak Yesɔ alǝk ayi atɔ shu te di, &lt;&lt;Tetɛɛ, mne nye ru ndi une wɔm. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Mǝne zhi te uwɔm kɔte kpaŋ takɛ, mbla amɛ ne atu ayi aneshir baŋ ndi aklikla ayaŋa, te bǝ tanyɛmɛ te ai wa ne shar me.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Ndi ne bla amɛ, azho ne kɔr ŋgon te di, &lt;&lt;Lazaru, ru abɛm! <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Aru abɛm, ne kpa aŋɔk amaa bǝn aza maa ne ririk anklu kɛ ruu aneshir, te na ku ti maa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:44">Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Zuk zhin ne wu mplɛ klu kɛ ruu aneshir kǝŋe te duŋɔ akɔmɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nǝ te zor ne atu ayi Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Neme Yahudawa tetɛk ndi ne nyɛ tek Meryamu, ne yik iki yiŋ ndi Yesɔ ne nai, ankyak a tanyɛmɛ ben Yesɔ. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Ama anuŋ ne miŋ men ne kam akɔmɔ te akɔte bla Ferisawa iki yiŋ ndi Yesɔ ne nai. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Fe ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik ben Ferisawa ne zhɔ sɔŋ ben angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ te ambuk.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:47">Adi,&lt;&lt;Ta te na anii? Tɔ ikiki yi vuŋ anu ndi ner waŋ azǝn nai! <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Ta te duŋɔ akɔmɔ amɛ, kɔte ŋɔwa atei tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɔu, fe Romawa atei nyɛ tǝ ta ntun mɔr ben aneshir amɔr.<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Ama izhiin ne min men ndi azhɔu te kayafa, ndi wa ai ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik ne se mɛ, adi, &lt;&lt;Izhin ye bliblik! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Ba zhin ne zhi te ire te iner zhin abɛ ku te aneshir bɔbɔk ne itun abɛ yik iyah.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Ba ne bla lɛ kǝŋe ne yik maa ba, ama ndi wa ayi ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik ne se mɛ ne bla te di, Yesɔ atei ku ne atu ayi aneshir abɛ Yahudawa, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />bai abɛba ankyak ba, ama bǝn aner abɛ Arik abaŋ ndi ne var ate nten, te abɛ gli ba aŋyaga te na duŋ abɛ yi zhiin. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Fe vuŋ rɛ bɛr yuŋɔ Yahudawa ne wɔb te aba abɛ ŋun Yesɔ.<verse eid="JHN 11:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Neme Yesɔ bane na tsin ndende ne miŋ Yahudawa ba. ama ne duŋ amɔ te gar ntun yiŋ ndi iyi gbahir ne zizik, ne ntun ndi azhɔi te Iferemu, amɔ wa ne sɔŋ ben abɛ zeu tsin.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Ndi mkpaŋ kɛ na igyaŋ yi tuk glak yi Yahudawa ne te gbahir, aneshir tetɛk ne ru are ntuntun te nyɛ Urshelima te na iki yi ben na men yi duŋ ba yi tsetser te mkpaŋ kɛ na igyaŋ bǝ te. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Ne zen wɔb Yesɔ, ndi ne aklikla ne ti kɛ Akabakɔŋ, ne rib akpa mɛn te di, &lt;&lt;Izhin yik kikini? Atei nyɛ igyaŋ yiŋɛi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik bǝn Ferisawa ne nek ilɛ te di iwaŋ ndi atei zhi amkpa waŋ ndi Yesɔ ayime, abɛ nyɛ bla te abɛ kɔte vuŋu.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Ne nuk Yesɔ anyɛ ne Batani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Iber Tani ne dǝk te igyaŋ yi tuk glak bǝ nyɛ, Yesɔ ne nyɛ Batani, ne amkpa awaŋ ndi Lazaru ayime, iwaŋ ndi Yesɔ ne lɛgu ne ku. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Ne naa Yesɔ kili yi tau. Marta azǝn naa ba kili me, Lazaru wa ayi ne miŋ kɛ abɛ kusɔŋ bǝn Yesɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Fe Meryamu abaŋ anyɛ wurdi shushum ane te anyaŋ; abuu akɔk ashur Yesɔ ne aza te akam mfumfuk tu maa ai su aza ma. Ankyak imiŋ kɔbɔ iŋur vuŋ ne mgbɔ shushum.<verse eid="JHN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Ama izhin ne miŋ kɛ abɛ zeu tsǝn amaa, Yahuda awɔnǝ Iskariyɔti, iwaŋ ndi ne alɔ tun zhi Yesɔ, te kyagu, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />&lt;&lt;Aye nii duŋ bane abaŋ wurdi awaŋa alɛb te ata azɔbɔ akam anǝk abɛ yini iyah kai? Ibǝ ya abɛ na ndum kɛ ise zhiin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Ibla maa iyiŋɛ te abɛ ka nek abɛ yini iyah ba, ama ayi ne zhib; iwa ayi ne nyak mgbɔ iye azɔbɔ, aben avu azɔb anuŋ ana kiyi nyɛr maa.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />&lt;&lt;Duŋu na iki yi na maa,&gt;&gt; Yesɔ adiu. &lt;&lt;Ne menezhi te Meryamu abɛ nyak wurdi me aŋub bɛr iyi rum. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />kɔte mkpaŋ takɛ izhin yi ben abɛ yini iyah ne miŋ min, ama ba kɔte mkpaŋ takɛ izhin tei yi bǝn abɛm ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yahudawa ne wɔb ŋun Lazaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Neme ntsan aneshir abɛ Yahudawa ne wɔ te Yesɔ ayi ne Batanya, fe agar amɔ, ba ne atu ye Yesɔ ankyak ba ama te bɛ yik Lazaru, waŋ ndi Yesɔ ne lɛgu ne bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Fe ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik ne kpa abiŋ te wɔb te aba abɛ ŋun Lazaru mayi, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />ne atu maa Yahudawa tetɛk ne kyak ba te tanyɛmɛ bǝn Yesɔ.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne yir Urshelima ndi Itum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Ne bɛr yi kuzi ntsan aneshir ndi ne nyɛ igyaŋ yi tuk glak ne wɔ te di Yesɔ asɔŋ anyɛ Urshelima. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Ne vu ayiya ilɛk te gar mla ben abɔu ne ankɔŋ, te te ahwa te di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">&lt;&lt;Igbar asak yi ben Arik!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">&lt;&lt;Anu adidik ayi ben iwaŋ ndi anyɛ ne sak kɛ Ŋgon!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">Anu adidik ayi ben Itum ne Isrela!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yesɔ ne yik Nŋa te yuŋɔ sɔŋu, ndi ne cɛr te di,<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />&lt;&lt;Kǝr izhin bǝ te sisik ba, ntun yi Siyona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">Tɔ zhin, Itum amin anyɛ, asa vǝvǝn nŋa te asɔŋ anyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Nǝ kuti abɛ zǝ Yesɔ tsen ba ne zhi iki yiŋɛ ba. Ama ndi ne nek Yesɔ ngɔŋ maa, fe akɔ shuzhi te ne cɛr iki yiŋɛ ne atu amaa te ne nau iki yiŋɛ.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Fe ntsan aneshir abaŋ ndi ne yi bǝn Yesɔ ndi ne lɛk Lazaru ne bɛ ne bla iki yiŋ ndi Yesɔ nenai. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Waŋa ayi ki yiŋ ndi ntsan aneshir ne akɔte yigu, te ne wɔ Yesɔ nena iki vuŋ anu. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Ankyak Ferisawa adi akpa men, &lt;&lt;Izhin yik, bata ne ya na iki nuŋ ba! Tɔ ir keŋ ndi aneshir bɔbɔk ne gɔnmimi azeu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Helɛnawa anuŋ ne wɔb yik Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Neme Helenawa anuŋ ne yi ne miŋ abaŋ ndi ne gar Urshelima te kɔmɔ zekuru Arik ne mkpaŋ kɛ igyaŋ. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Ne nyɛ ben Filibus, ndi are Batseda ne gar kɛ Galili te di, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, ta wɔb te ta bǝ yik Yesɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Fe Filibus akɔte bla Anduru; ankyak yayaa men akɔte bla Yesɔ.<verse eid="JHN 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;mkpaŋ neka tǝ ndi atei nek Izu Neshir ngɔŋ maa. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Mbla zhin lɛ didik, mba ne tib mgbyaŋ alikama ne mimi te duŋǝ ku ba itei yi kiki maa, ama ite ku itei gli mgbyaŋ kpu tetɛk nyɛmɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Iner waŋ ndi anyer ivli maa atei suk kɛ, iwaŋ ndi ate kyak ivli maa ne atu amuŋ ne gɔnmimi kǝŋe atei yik kɛ yaŋ klɛtu. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Waŋ ndi awɔb te wa abɛ zekuru me atei zǝm; te amkpa awaŋ ndi m yime, agene amuŋ abɛ na yi amɔ. Tetɛɛ amuŋ atei nǝgu ŋgon.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne lɛ ne atu ayi iku amaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />Yesɔ adi&lt;&lt;Azizaŋa susun muŋ ilɛn me, M tei ndi kikin? &lt;Tetɛɛ, tam zhɔk ne mkpaŋ keŋɛi?&gt; Mm, ama waŋa ayi ki yiŋ ndi mne nyɛ te mbǝ yik iya ne mkpaŋ kǝŋe!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Tetɛɛ, duŋ sak mi ibǝ yi ngɔŋ!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Ankyak ikɔr ilɛ rɛ igbarshu te di, &lt;&lt;Mne ka nek Isak mi ngɔŋ, M tei na nek ngɔŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Ntsan aneshir ndi ne yi ne amkpama te wɔ ikɔro adi ai inas ŋur, anuŋ adi ai ine shar ayou Arik alɛ ben abɔu.<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Ama Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Ikɔr kǝŋe iyi ne atu min, ba atu amuŋ ba. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Azizaŋa waŋa ai mkpaŋ kɛ te aneshir abɛ gɔnmimi ambuk; azizaŋa atei tun ine gli gɔnmimi kǝŋe atibe. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Ama nga, atei lɛk me ne bɛ te baŋ me ne gɔnmimi te gli akɔmɔ ne shu, M tei gbur aneshir bɔbɔk ngli nyɛ ne atu muŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Yesɔ ne bla amɛ te abɛ tsar ir iku keŋ ndi tei vuŋ wa.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Ntsɛn anɛshire adi, &lt;&lt;Icɛr yi Musa nǝ bla ta tedi Kristi batei ku ba, fe tǝ aye ni duŋu udi, &lt;Atei lik Izu neshir ne bɛ te gliu akɔ ne shu? Iŋɔwa ayi, Izu neshirɛi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Ankyak Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Ilaŋ amkpa itei yi bǝn abɛ zhin mkpaŋ watsɔb. Izhin bǝ tsen ndi amkpa anak ari laŋ, kǝr ibu ibǝ nyɛ vuŋ zhin ba. Iner waŋ ndi atsǝn ne bu ba zhi amkpa awaŋ ndi agaru ba. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Izhin bǝ tanyɛmɛ bǝn ilaŋ amkpa, ndi nak iri yi ben abɛ zhin, te izhin tei yi aneshir abɛ laŋ amkpa.&gt;&gt; Ndi Yesɔ lɛ klɛ, ne duŋ ba te akɔte su tu maa ayir.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yahudawa ba ne tanyɛme ben Yesɔ ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Neme ndi Yesɔ nena iki yi vuŋ anu yiŋɛ bɔbɔk ne ayi men, ba ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɔu ba. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Te duŋ lɛ kɛ bla Ishaya ine bla shar yi Arik ibǝ shaga:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">&lt;&lt;Ŋgon, iŋɔwa ne tanyɛmɛ ne lɛ kɛ bla mɔr? Arik nena tsar iŋɔwa mgbyamgbyaŋ maa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Neme bane tanyɛmɛ ayir ba, te Ishaya nena bla te di,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />&lt;&lt;Arik ne ku ayi amene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">Te na ku asusun amen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">Te duŋ batei yik ne ayi amen ba, ba tei na zhi ne asusun amen ba, batei na kam aŋyak ben abɛm ba, tem duŋ ba are.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Ishaya ne bla shar iye Arik ne bla te di, mne yik ngɔŋ kɛ Yesɔ te lɛ ne atu maa.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Fe ne mkpaŋa angɔngɔŋ Yahudawa anuŋ ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɔu. Ama atu ye Ferisawa ba ne lɛ agli arumɔ ba, te kǝr abɛ gli ba arumɔ ne miŋ Akabakɔŋ ba; <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />te anyer igbar yi aneshir anaŋ yi Arik.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilɛ kɛ Yesɔ tei te ambuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Ankyak Yesɔ alɛ ne kɔr ngɔŋ te di, &lt;&lt;Iwaŋ ndi ate tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɛm, ba ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn nga ankyak ba, ama ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn waŋ ndi ne shar me. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Waŋ ndi ate yik me ne yik waŋ ndi ne shar me. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Mne nyɛ gɔnmimi ndi laŋ amkpa, te waŋ ndi ate tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɛm kǝr abɛ sɔŋ ne bu ba.<verse eid="JHN 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Iwaŋ ndi ate wɔ lɛ muŋ te kyak zǝ kɛ, bam M tei te ba ŋas ba, te bam ne nyɛ te gɔnmimi ambuk ba, ama mbǝ ta kɛ zhɔk. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Abaŋ ndi ne kyak me te na kyak ta lɛ muŋ ayi ne waŋ ndi atei te ba ambuk. Ilɛ keŋ ndi mne lɛ kɛ tetɛɛ ba ambuk ne bɛr klɛtu. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Tǝ bam ne lɛ ne mgbyamgbyaŋ muŋ ba, ama Tetɛɛ waŋ ndi ne shar me ne nǝm lɛ keŋ ndi M tei bla te na lɛ kɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Mne zhi te ilɛ keŋ ndi ne nǝm ne kǝ igli ivli kɛ yaŋ klɛtu nyɛmɛ. Neme iki yiŋ ndi Mblai ayi ki yiŋ ndi Tetɛɛ ne blam tem blai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne ŋlaa abɛ zeu tsin aza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Ndi iber yi na igyaŋ yi tuk glak bane zen nyɛ ba. Yesɔ ne zhi te mkpaŋ ne te ndi wa atei duŋ gɔnmimi kǝŋe te gar ben Tetɛɛ maa. Ne nyɛr aneshir amaa ŋgɔŋ ndi ne yi ne gɔŋmimi, ne nyɛr ba gar klɛtu.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Yesɔ ben abɛ zeu tsin ne zen li ikili yi amgbalu, shetan ne ka men shɔk Yahuda Iskariyɔti ne susun maa, izu Siman, te abɛ vuŋ Yesɔ alɛb. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesɔ ne zhi te Tetɛɛ maa ne ka men anugu mgbyamgbyaŋ ne atu yi kɔte ni, ne zhi te iwa are ben Arik iwa atei na kama kɔmɔ ben Arik; <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />ankyak Yesɔ alu ne amkpa ne li ikili mǝne, te tun anklu akɛ abɛm amaa, te baŋ nŋa anklu kɛ yis amashir akpa ne tiŋ maa. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Fe ashur amashir ne amkpadeb akǝ ŋla ki te aŋla abɛ zeu tsen aza, te zuk nŋa anklu kɛ yis amashir ndi ne kpa kɛ ne tiŋ te yis aza mǝne.<verse eid="JHN 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Ndi ne nyɛ ben Biturus, fe adiu, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ utei ŋlam azai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Bau ne zhi iki yiŋ ndi mnai ba, ama utei zhi ne mkpaŋ watsɔb.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Biturus adi, &lt;&lt;Bau tei ŋlam aza ba.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Mba mte ŋlau aza ba, bau tei yi ne zǝm tsen ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Biturus adi, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, kǝr ubǝ ŋla aza muŋ ankyak ba, ama ubǝ ŋlam ben aŋɔk amuŋ ben itu muŋ, biŋe!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Iwaŋ ndi ne ka su ayi tsetser ba na wɔb te bɛ su ba atei ŋlau aza maa ankyak. Izhin yi tsetser, ama ba kɔte ŋɔwa ne miŋ min ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yesɔ neka men azhi iwaŋ ndi atei vuŋu alɛb, waŋ ayi ki yiŋ ndi adi ba kɔte ŋɔwa ayi tsetser ba.<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Ndi ne ka ŋla ba aza ma bɔbɔk, abaŋ anklu amaa akɛ bem asu te kama te zǝ sɔŋ ne amkpa ane sɔŋ amaa. Arib ba tedi, &lt;&lt;Izhin ne zhi iki yiŋ ndi mne na zhin ne yi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />&lt;&lt;Izhin zhɔm te ine Tsar, ben &lt;Ŋgɔŋ,&gt; iyi anenen amɛ, waŋai ir keŋ ndi m yime. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Azizaŋa ndi nga, myi ne Tsar amin bǝn Ŋgɔŋ amin, mne ŋla zhin aza, izhine ba min yi izhin bǝ ŋla akpa min aza. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Mne nka ntsar zhin iki yiŋ ndi izhin tei na ir keŋ ndi mne na zhin. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Mbla zhin lɛ didik, igen ba naŋ atukɔ amaa ba, ka iwaŋ ndi asharu anaŋ waŋ ndi ne asharu ma. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Neme ndi izhin ne zhi ikiki yiŋɛ, izhin tei ta anu didik ndi izhin te nai.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne bla waŋ ndi atei vuŋu alɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />Yesɔ adi,&lt;&lt;Bam di izhineba bɔbɔk min ba; mne zhi abaŋ ndi mne hria ba. Ama iki yiŋ ndi ne cɛrǝ ibǝ shaga: &lt;Iwaŋ ndi ta li ikili muŋ ai wa ate zor ben abɛm.&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Mbla zhin ilɛ kǝŋe te iki yiŋɛ ibǝ shi na, ndi ite na izhin tei tanyɛmɛ te Ayi nga myi Ayi nga. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Mbla zhin lɛ didik, iwaŋ ndi ate ta waŋ ndi mne sharu ne ta nga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne bla waŋ ndi atei vuŋ wa alɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Ndi Yesɔ ne bla lɛ kǝŋe, ne wɔ lɛn susun te lɛ ndende te di, &lt;&lt;Mbla zhin lɛ didik, izhiin ne miŋ min atei vuŋ me alɛb.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Abɛ zeu tsin akɔ lɛ ne akpa men te di, tei ayi ŋɔwa ne miŋ mǝnei. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Izhin ne miŋ kɛ abɛ tsene maa ndi Yesɔ anyeru, akɔ sɔŋ anyaŋu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Siman Biturus adi Yesɔ, &lt;&lt;Bla ta ulɛ ne atu ayi ŋɔwai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Abɛ zǝ Yesɔ tsin ate gbahir ben abɔu te rib bu te di, &lt;&lt;Ŋgon, ayi ŋɔwai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Ai waŋ ndi M tei nǝgu mbwab borodi ndi mne baŋ kɛ ne agbǝgba.&gt;&gt; Fe akɔ su ŋɔk ne agbǝgba ma te baŋ mbwab borodi me, te nek Yahuda Iskariyɔti, izu Siman. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Ndi Yahuda ne ta borodi me shetan iyir susun maa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:27">Yesɔ adiu Yahuda, &lt;&lt;nama andanda tena iki yiŋ ndi utei nai!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Ama inuŋ ne miŋ kɛ li iklime bane zhi iki yiŋ ndi Yesɔ ne di Yahuda ilɛ kǝŋe ba. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Ndi Yahuda iwa ayi ne Gli mgbɔ iyi shur azɔbɔ, abɛ zeu tsin anuŋ ayik tedi Yesɔ adiu abe te alɛb iki yiŋ ndi atei na igyaŋa neyi, kɔ abɛ nek abɛ iyah iki nuŋ. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Ndi Yahuda ne ta borodi me, aru abɛm. Ibu ne ka te ne kpaŋa.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkan lɛ yi nek yayas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Ndi Yahuda ne kama tibɛ, Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Azizaŋa ne nek Izu neshir ngɔŋ maa; nena nek Arik Ŋgon ne atu maa. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Atei nek Arik ngɔŋ ne atu yi Izu maa, Arik wa ne tu maa atei duŋ anǝk Izu Neshir ŋgɔŋ maa, atei na amɛ mkpaŋ zhiin.<verse eid="JHN 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Amumun amuŋ ndi m nyɛr ba, M tei yi ben abɛ zhin ne mkpaŋ watsɔb. Izhin tei wɔb me, ir keŋ ndi mne bla Yahudawa, mna bla zhin amɛ: Amkpa awaŋ ndi mgaru ba zhin tei garu yir ba.<verse eid="JHN 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Me nek ilɛ yayas: Izhin bǝ nyɛr akpa min. Ir keŋ ndi mne nyɛr zhin, neme izhin bǝ nak nyɛr akpa min. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Izhin te nyer akpa, neme aneshir bɔbɔk atei zhi te izhin yi abɛ tsene amuŋ.<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Biturus aribu te di, &lt;&lt;Ŋgon, ugar amei?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Amkpa awaŋ ndi mgaru, bau tei zǝm yir azizaŋa ba, ama uka zǝm ne mkpaŋ kɛ nyɛ ne ti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Biturus adi, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, ayi nii duŋ bam tei zeu yir azizaŋa kai? M tei nek tu muŋ tem ku ne atu min te izhin bǝ yik ivli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Ankyak Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Une nek tu mi te bǝ ku ne atu amuŋ? Mblau lɛ didik, utei kyak zhim amkpaŋ atar agbak ateishe tuk!<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesɔ adi nga myi ankɔŋ ane kɔmɔ ben Tetɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yesɔ adi ba. &lt;&lt;Kǝr zhin bǝ duŋ asusun amin abɛ cɔk ala ba,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Izhin bǝ ta nyɛmɛ ne susun ben Arik, izhin bǝ na tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɛm. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Nǝ kɔb kɛ Tetɛɛ muŋ kiki yime tetɛk; ndi ba iyi amɛ ba mbǝ mbla zhin. M tei nkɔmɔ amɔ te nkɔmɔ ntǝ na amkpa nyak zhin. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Ndi Mte ngar na amkpa nyak zhin, M tei nkam nyak te nyɛ mvu zhin te izhin bǝ sɔŋ ben abɛm. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Izhin ne zhi ankɔŋ ane gar amkpa awaŋ ndi mgara&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ aye ankɔŋ ane gar ben Tetɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tɔma adiu tedi, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, ba ta ne zhi amkpa awaŋ ndi ugara ba, ta tei na kikin te zhi ankɔŋɔi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesɔ ata anyɛ me, &lt;&lt;Nga myi ankɔŋ tena yi izub tena nek ivli. Inuŋ ba tei gar ben Tetɛɛ ba se ne zǝ ben abɛm. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Abɛ di izhin nena zhim, izhin bǝ nak na zhi Tetɛɛ amuŋ maa yime, Nak baŋ rɛ azizaŋa, izhin ne zhiu te na yigu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filibus adi, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, tsar ta Tetɛɛ ma iyiŋɛ itei mla tama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesɔ mtanyeme: &lt;&lt;Bau ne zhim kai, Filibus, Ndi Mne mbaŋ mkpaŋ bene abɛ zhin? Iwaŋ ndi ate yik me ne yik Tetɛɛ. Ukam di &lt;Mtsar zhin Tetɛɛ muŋ kikini&gt;? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Bau ne tanyɛmɛ ne susun te myi ne miŋ kɛ Tetɛɛ, te Tetɛɛ ana yine miŋ muŋ kai? Nkanlɛ yiŋ ndi Mbla zhin ba yi muŋ ankyak ba. Ayi Tetɛɛ waŋ ndi ayi ne miŋ muŋ, ayi wa azǝn na ndum maa. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Tanyɛmɛ ne susun bǝn abɛm ndi mdi myi ne miŋ kɛ Tetɛɛ ana yine miŋ muŋ; Ubǝ na tanyɛmɛ ne kiki yi vuŋ anu mɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Mbla zhin izub, iwaŋ ndi ne tanyɛmɛ bene bɛm atei na kiki yiŋ ndi mzǝn nai. Atei na kiki yi naŋ yiŋɛ, te nga M tei mkɔmɔ ben Tetɛɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Ankyak M tei na iki yiŋ ndi izhin te bene ne sak muŋ, te duŋ Izu Arik abɛ gli ngɔŋ agli Tetɛɛ me. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Izhin bǝ ben kɔte ni ne sak muŋ, M tei na zhin aneyi.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne nek anu akɛ Izhu Tsetser</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />&lt;&lt;Izhin te nyer me, izhin tei na iki yiŋ ndi mne ndi zhin bǝ nai. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Fe M tei mben Tetɛɛ muŋ, iwa atei na nek zhin nuŋ ne lɔk zhin ma te abɛ zǝ bǝn abɛ zhin kɔmɔ yaŋ klɛtu <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Ayi Izhu tsetser, iyiŋ ndi abla ta zub ne atu aye Arik. Gɔnmimi ba tei tanyɛmɛ bene bɔu ba, te gɔnmimi ba yigu ba te abɛ ka zhiu. Ama izhin ne zhiu, te ayi ne miŋ min, atei na gli zhin atsene.<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Bam tei duŋ zhin ndi agɛn ba; me tei nyɛ ben abɛ zhin. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Ba tei baŋ kpaŋ ba, gɔnmimi ba tei na yik me ba, ama zhine ba tei yik me. Tǝ me yi tsitsir, izhin tei na yi atsitsir min yime. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Nǝ bɛr yuŋɔ izhin zhi tem yi ben Tetɛɛ muŋ izhin na yi ne miŋ muŋ,me na yi ne miŋ muŋ.<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Waŋ ndi ate wɔ lɛ kɛ bla muŋ te zǝ kɛ, ayi wa ne nyer me. Iwaŋ ndi ate nyer me Tetɛɛ muŋ atei na nyeru. Nga muŋ yime M tei na nyeru te na tsa ru tu muŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Fe Yahuda (Ndi bai Yahuda awɔnǝ Iskariyɔti ba) adi, &lt;&lt;Ama, Ngɔŋ, ayi nii duŋu wɔb te bǝ tsar ta tu mi ba gɔnmimi bɔbɔk kai?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesɔ atanyeu ma, &lt;&lt;Iwaŋ ndi ate nyer me, atei zǝ tsar muŋ. Tetɛɛ muŋ atei nyeru, ta tei nyɛ Nga ben Tetɛɛ amuŋ ne kɔmɔr. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Iwaŋ ndi ba te nyer me ba tei zǝ tsar muŋ ba. Nkanlɛ yiŋ ndi zhin wɔi ba yi muŋ ba; iyi Tetɛɛ waŋ ndi ne shar me. <verse eid="JHN 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Kiki yiŋ ndi me blai ndim nnɛ yi ben abɛ zhin <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Ama ne lɔk zhin ma Izhu Tsetser, iwaŋ ndi Tetɛɛ atei sharu ne sak muŋ, atei tsar zhin kiki bɔbɔk te na shu zhin kiki yiŋ ndi Mne bla zhin aneyi. <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Mne duŋ zhin ne sik susun; Mne nek zhin sik susun muŋ. Bam ne nek zhin ir keŋ ndi gɔnmimi nege ba. Kǝr izhin bɛ duŋ asusun amin abɛ yi ne mɔ ba kǝr izhin bǝ duŋ te sǝsǝk ba <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />&lt;&lt;Izhin ne wɔ Mne di,&lt;Mtai duŋ zhin Mtai na nkam nyɛ ben abɛ zhin.&gt; Abɛdi zhin ne tanyɛme ben abɛm, izhin tei nyɛr tedi me kɔmɔ ben Tetɛɛ, te Tetɛɛ ayi ŋgɔŋ anaŋ me <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Mbla zhin azizaŋa tǝ bǝ shi na, te ka shi tanyɛmɛ <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Bam tei na lɛ bǝn abɛ zhin kɔmɔ ne tii ba, te Tum ne gli gɔnmimi a nyɛ. Ba na zǝm hria ba. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />ama gɔnmimi itei zhi tem ne nyer Tetɛɛ te na iki yiŋ ndi ne di mnai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">&lt;&lt;Nyɛ zhin, ta bǝ duŋ amkpa awaŋa.<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Itiŋ Inabi ben nga maa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Nga Myi itiŋ Inabi didik, fena Tetɛɛ amuŋ wa ayi ne ahwaŋa. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Tetɛɛ amuŋ agyak kɔte nga takɛ ndi bate dɔ gbar ba, fe kɔte nga takɛ ndi ite dɔ gbar ana Ngama te bǝ dɔ gbar ngɔŋ. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Izhin menyi tsetser ne ilɛ keŋ ndi mne men blaa zhin. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Izhin bǝ yi ne miŋ muŋ, te Nga mbǝna yi ne miŋ min. Nga nkuŋkun ba shur dɔ ne tu maa ba; se ne yi ne mkpuŋkpa kɛ tiŋ Inabime. Izhineba iminyi ba zhin tei shur dɔ ba se izhin neyi ne miŋ muŋ. <verse eid="JHN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Yesɔ adi,&lt;&lt;Nga myi itiŋ inabime; izhineba yi ngǝŋga ma. Neshir atei ne miŋ muŋ te mnayi ne miŋ maa, atei shur dɔ tetɛk; mba mte yime ba ba zhin tei na kinuŋ yir ba.<verse eid="JHN 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Atei ndi inuŋ ate kyak yi bene bɛm, ayi ndi nga inebi ikɛ tsǝm tyak zhɔk te ne klu; ir ngǝŋga ma avui, atuk ashur ne lu te gɔŋǝ. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Ate yi ndi izhin te yi ne miŋ muŋ tem nayi ne miŋ min, rib zhin kɔte nii ndi izhin wɔ bǝ, fe atei nek zhin neyi. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Iyiŋɛ iyi amɛ tǝ bɛ nek Tetɛɛ amuŋ ngɔŋ maa, te izhin bǝ dɔ agbar tetɛk, tena tsar akpa amin te izhin yi abɛ tsene amuŋ.<verse eid="JHN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />&lt;&lt;Ndi Tetɛɛ ne nyer me, neme ŋgam na nyɛr zhin. Fena izhin bǝ sɔŋ ne miŋ kɛ tanyɛme muŋ. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Ate yi ndi izhin te zǝ inǝk lǝlɛ muŋ, izhin tei sɔŋ ne nyer muŋ, ir keŋ ndi mne zǝ lǝlɛ yi Tetɛɛ muŋ tena sɔŋ ne nyer maa. <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Mne blaa zhin ki yiŋɛ te nyɛr muŋ bǝ shaga netu min te inyɛr min bǝ shaga. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Inǝk lɛ muŋɔ idi: Nyer zhin akpa min ndi Mne nyer zhin. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Nyer ngɔŋ ba yi bǝn inuŋ naŋ amɛ ba, te nɛ nǝk tu maa ne atu akpa amaa. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Izhineba yi akpa amuŋ ndi izhin te zǝ lɛ kǝ bla muŋ. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Bam na zhɔzhin te agen ba, te igen bane zhi ndum kɛ atukɔ amaa ba. Neme, Mne zhɔzhin akpa amuŋ, te kɔte nii ndi Mne tei ben Tetɛɛ Mne nduŋ zhin izhi. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Bai zhineba ne hriam ba, ama ayi Ŋgawa mne hria zhin tena ndi zhin bǝ te dɔ agbar ngɔŋ ndi iyi kuŋkun, ir kɛ agbar ane yaŋ klɛtu. Fe Tetɛɛ atei nek zhin iki yiŋ ndi izhin te ribǝ ne sak muŋ. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Waŋa ai nǝk ilɛ yayas muŋ: Nyer zhin akpa amin.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aner abɛ gɔŋmimi akyak abɛ tsǝn amaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />&lt;&lt;Ate yi ndi aner abɛ gɔnmimi akyak zhin, izhin bǝ zhi te ne kuti akyak me. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Ate yi ndi izhin yi abɛ gɔnmimi, ai ibɛ nyer zhin. Ndi iyime, ba zhin yi abɛ gɔnmimi ba, ama ayi ngam ne hria zhin ne miŋ abɛ gɔnmimi. Waŋa ayi kiyiŋ ndi gɔnmimi kyak zhine. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Izhin bǝ shuzhi lǝlɛ ndi mne bla zhin neyi: &lt;Igen ba anaŋ atukɔ amaa ba.&gt; Ate sak me iya, atei na saak zhin iya iminyi. Ate yi ndi ne gli tsar muŋ ne asusun amen, atei na gli tsar mine. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Atei naa zhin ki mimin ne atu ayi sak muŋ, te bane zhi waŋ ndi ne shar me ba. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Abɛdi bam ne nyɛ te lɛ bene bɛba ba, bai bɛ yi abɛ lalɛ ba. Fe, ndi iyi amɛ, ba atei di te aba ne yaŋ zhi zumimin men ba. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Iwaŋ ndi ate kyak me akyak Tetɛɛ muŋ maayi. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Abɛdi bam nena kiyi duŋ avuŋ anu neyi amen ba, bai bɛ yik akpa amen abɛ lalɛ ba. Ndi azizaŋa neka yik kiki yi vuŋ anu yiŋɛ, te ne kyak me iyi ben Tetɛɛ muŋ. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Ama iyiŋɛ nena teduŋ nkanlɛ yi cɛr iyi Musa bǝ shaga: &lt;Ne kyak me iyi sha ne yaŋ lalɛ.&gt;<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />&lt;&lt;Ndi ine nǝ kli didik are ben Arik atei nyɛ, iwaŋ ndi ngam M tei sharu rɛ bǝn Tetɛɛ, Izhu Tsetser ne zub waŋ ndi aru are bǝn Tetɛɛ, atei bla zhin lɛ ne atu amuŋ. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Fe izhineba minyi tei bla lɛ ne atu muŋ, te izhin ne menyi bene bɛm ne kuti.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />&lt;&lt;Iki yiŋɛ Mne men blaa zhin te duŋ kǝr izhin bǝ duŋ kam ti ne tanyɛme yi susun min ba. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Atei yar zhin agli rumɔ ne Akaba; ilɛ didik, mkpaŋ inyɛ te iwaŋ ndi ate ŋun zhin atei yik te uwa ana Arik ndum. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Atei na kiki yiŋɛ te bane zhi Tetɛɛ kɔ nga ba. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Mne bla zhin kiyiŋɛ, teduŋ mkpaŋa te nyɛ izhin tei shuzhi te Mne gbaŋ zhin atɔŋ. Bam ne bla zhin iyiŋɛ ne kuti ba tem Neri yi ben abɛ zhin.<verse eid="JHN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndum kɛ Izhu Tsetser</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />&lt;&lt;Azizaŋa Ŋgam gar ben waŋ ndi ne shar me, &lt;neme inuŋ bane rib mǝ te, &lt;ugar amɛ ba?&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Fe Mne mbla kiki yiŋɛ, asusun amine neka luk. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Ama Mbla zhin zub: ne rɛ tem nduŋ zhin, Mba Mte nduŋ zhin ba, ine lɔk zhin ma batei nyɛ ba. Ama Mte nkɔmɔ, M tei shar zhin ne wu. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Ate nyɛ, atei duŋ aneshir abɛ gɔnmimi abɛ zhi te ba bla lɛ didik ba ir keŋ ndi ilalɛ iyime bǝn ina didik bǝn ambuk aye Arik: <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />ne garke lalɛ, te aner ne kyak tanyɛmɛ bene bɛm; <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />ba bla lɛ didik ba ne gar kɛ na didik, te Mgar bǝn Tetɛɛ, ndi ba zhin tei na yik me ba; <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />fe ne gar kɛ te ambuk, te ine ruk gɔnmimi kǝŋe Arik neka teu ŋas iyi zhɔk adɔmɔ.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />&lt;&lt;Myi ne kiki tetɛk iyi bla zhin, inaŋ ir keŋ ndi izhin tei ya hrui. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Ama ne yiŋɛ, Izhu iyi Arik, uwaŋ ndi abla lɛ didik ne tu aye Arik, atei gli zhin akɔmɔ ne lɛ zub. batei bla lɛ yi tu maa ba; atei bla iki yiŋ ndi wa ne wɔi, tena bla ki yiŋ ndi itei nyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Atei Gli nek ngɔŋ aglim ma ne ta ikiyiŋ ndi iyi muŋ tena duŋ zhin bǝ zhi. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Bɔbɔk iki iyiŋ ndi Tetɛɛ ayime ne yi iyi muŋ, waŋa ai ki iyiŋ ndi Mdi te Izhu atei ta ikiyiŋ ndi iyi muŋ tena duŋ zhin bǝ zhi.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilɛn asusun abɛ zeu na ndum amaa itei kam yi nyɛr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />&lt;&lt;Nǝ ivǝ mkpaŋ watsɔb ba zhin tei na yik me ba, fe ndi ivǝ mkpaŋa te gayir izhin tei na yik me.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Anuŋ ne miŋ kɛ abɛ zeu na ndum maa adi akpa men, &lt;&lt;Iki bla maa yiŋɛ adi anii, &lt;Tǝ ivǝ mkpaŋ watsɔb ba zhin tei na yik me ba, fe ivǝ mkpaŋ watsɔb ite gayir izhin tei na yik me,&gt; fena &lt;Tǝ Mgar ben Tetɛɛ&gt;?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Anak zen rib bu, &lt;&lt;Anii duŋu adi &lt;ivǝ mkpaŋ&gt;? Bata ne zhi kiyiŋ ndi ablai ma ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesɔ neyik te azǝn di abai rib bu ilɛ kɛ blama, fe akɔ diba, &lt;&lt;Izhin rib akpa iki yiŋ ndi Mne ndime, &lt;Nǝ ivǝ mkpaŋ watsɔb ba zhin tei yik me ba, fe ndi ivǝ mkpaŋ watsɔb te gayir izhin tei yik me&gt;? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Mblazhin izub, izhin tei zhin tena lɛn asusun, ama aner abɛ gɔnmimi atei mlak anyɛr. Asusun amin atei luk, ama iluk asusun min itei kam yi nyɛr. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Itei yi ndi Iwa atai ŋli vǝvǝn azhin ŋlimɛ te mkpaŋ kǝ ŋlimɛ ne te; ama ate ŋli vǝvǝne aŋur asuk ne iyah iyi ŋlimǝ te nyer maa ne ŋli vǝvǝne iduŋ gɔnmimi izhi te ne ŋli vǝvǝn. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Ndi iyeme bene bɛ zhin: azizaŋa izhin yine lɛn asusun, ama Mtei na yik zhin fe izhin tei nyɛr, ndi inuŋ ba atei na baŋ nyɛr mine atibe ba. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Ndi bɛr te nyɛ, ba zhin tei na rib me ikinuŋ ba. Mbla zhin izub, Tetɛɛ muŋ atei nek zhin kɔte nii ndi izhin te rib ne sak muŋ. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Har azǝzaŋa ba zhin ne zen rib kinuŋ ne sak muŋ ba; rib zhin te izhin tei ta, fena nyer min itei shaga.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iliru ne gɔŋmimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />&lt;&lt;Neme Mne men zen bla kaŋkaŋ lǝlɛ yi lɔ izhi, mkpaŋ nyɛ ndi bam Mtei na lɛ ir kɛ lǝlɛ yi lɔ zhi iyiŋɛ ba, ama M tei blai ru abɛm netu ayi Tetɛɛ muŋ. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Ndi bǝn te nyɛ, izhin tei rib Tetɛɛ ki ne sak muŋ; Bam ndi te M tei rib zhin Tetɛɛ amuŋ ikinuŋ netu amin ba. <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />Ba yi amɛ ba, Tetɛɛ muŋ ne tu maa anyɛr zhin te izhin ne nyɛr me tena tanyɛmɛ te Mne rɛ ben Arik. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Mne nyɛ rɛ ben Tetɛɛ fe azizaŋa Myi ne gɔnmimi kǝŋe tem mkam kɔmɔ ben Tetɛɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Ankyak abɛ zeu tsǝn amaa adiu, &lt;&lt;Azizaŋa utashi lɛ ru abɛm ne yaŋ nkanlɛ yi lɔ zhi. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Azizaŋa ta tashi zhi te une zhi kiki bɔbɔk ndi ba se unena yik nuŋ aribu lǝlɛ ba. Iyiŋɛ iduŋ ta ne tanyɛmɛ te ure bǝn Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Izhin ne tanyɛmɛ azizaŋai?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />&lt;&lt;Ama mkpaŋ nyɛ, fe nǝ ka nyɛ, ndi izhin tei klu var, kɔte ŋɔwa atei klu akɔmɔ ne kɔmaa. izhin tei duŋ mǝ kiki muŋ. Neme bai nga kiki muŋ ba, tǝ Tetɛɛ muŋ ayi bene bɛm.<verse eid="JHN 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />&lt;&lt;Mne ka mbla zhin kiki yiŋɛ, te ne miŋ muŋ izhin bǝ ta sik susun. Nǝ gɔnmimi kǝŋe atei wɔb zhin ne akla. Ama vuŋ zhin susun! Tǝ mne ka lieru ne gɔŋmimi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne ben Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Ndi Yesɔ neka di iyiŋɛ aklɛ, alǝk ayi atɔ shumɔ tedi:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="JHN 17:1">&lt;&lt;Tetɛɛ muŋ, mkpaŋa neka nyɛ. Duŋ sak Izu mi bǝyi Ngɔŋ, te Zu mi abɛ duŋ sak mi bǝyi ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Tǝ ai wa une nǝgu mgbyamgbyaŋ netu aneshir bɔbɔk tǝ bɛ nek ivli kɛ yaŋ klɛ netu abaŋ ndi une nǝgu neba. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Ivli kɛ yaŋ klɛ: te abɛ zhiu, Arik izhiin ankyak ne izub, bǝn Yesɔ Kristi, iwaŋ ndi une sharu. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Mne lɛk ngɔŋ mi ngli nyɛmɛ ne gɔnmimi ne klɛ ndum keŋ ndi une dim mna kɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Fe azizaŋa, Tetɛɛ, lɛk ngɔŋ muŋ ne timi ngɔŋ keŋ ndi Me yime ne kǝ bene bɔu te gɔnmimi bǝshi sɔŋ.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne ben netu abɛ zeu tsǝn amaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />&lt;&lt;Mǝne duŋ abaŋ ndi une nǝm aneba ne zhiu ne gɔnmimi. Neka yi ami; une nǝm aneba tǝ nɛ wɔm te zǝ ilɛ mi. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Azizaŋa neka zhi te kɔte nii ndi une nǝm ire bene bɔu. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Tǝ Mne nek ba lǝlɛ mi yiŋ ndi une nǝm neyi tǝ nɛ tei. Ne na zhi tem Mrɛ bene bɔu, tena tanyɛmɛ te iyi zub ai wa une shar me. <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Mben netu amene. Bam Mben netu ayi gɔnmimi ba, ama netu aye abaŋ ndi une nǝm aneba, te ayemi. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Kiki muŋ bɔbɔk iyi mi, neme kiki mi bɔbɔk iyi muŋ. Fe inǝk ngɔŋ ne nyɛ bene bɛm netu amen. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Fe bam tei nkam sɔŋ ne gɔnmimi kǝŋe ba; ama aba anaga ri yi ne gɔnmimi, fena Ngam nyɛ bene bɔu. Tsetser Tetɛɛ, tuŋ ba nyak ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ sak mi, isak keŋ ndi une nǝm ne kǝ, teduŋ ba abɛyi azhiin ndi tayi azhiin. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Ndi Mne ri yi bene bǝba, Mne kyu ba ngli anenen ne sak keŋ ndi une nǝm ma. Inuŋ bane naŋadɔ ba, se ner waŋ ndi ate duŋ nkan lɛ bǝ shaga ne tu maa.<verse eid="JHN 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />&lt;&lt;M nyɛ bene bɔu azizaŋa, ama mbla kiki yiŋɛ tem nak ri yi ne gɔnmimi, te duŋ ba abɛ Gli nyer muŋ iyi shaga ne akpa mɛn. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Mne nek ba nkanlɛ mi fe igɔnmimi ne kyak ba, te aba ba yi abɛ gɔnmimi ba ndi Nga bam yine gɔnmimi ba. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Iben muŋ bam ndi te ubǝ baŋ ba igli tibɛ ne gɔnmimi ba, ama ubǝ ŋub ba netu ne na iki mimin. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Ba ayi abɛ gɔnmimi ba, ndi Nga bam nayi ne gɔnmimi ba. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Duŋ ba aklɛ ne lɛ kɛ zub; ilɛ mi kɛ iyi didik. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Ndi une shar me ne miŋ gɔnmimi, Mne na shar ba ne miŋ kɛ gɔnmimi. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Ne atu mǝne Mne nek tu muŋ, te aba imenyi abɛ nǝgu atu men inek didik.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne ben ne atu abɛ zǝ Arik bɔbɔk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />Iben muŋ bane atu amen ankyak ba. Mna mben ne atu abaŋ ndi atei tanyɛmɛ ne susun bene bɛm ne nkɔŋ kɛ lɛmi, <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Tǝ duŋ bɔbɔk mǝne abɛyi zhiin, Tetɛɛ, ndi uwa uyi ne miŋ muŋ tem nayi ne miŋ mi. Tǝ abɛyi azhiin ne miŋ mɔr teduŋ gɔnmimi bǝ tanyɛmɛ te ai wa une shar me. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Mne nek ba ngɔŋ keŋ ndi une nǝm, te duŋ ba abɛyi zhiin ndi tayi zhiin: <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Nga ne miŋ men fena uwa ne miŋ muŋ. Tǝ duŋ biŋe tu mǝne bǝ yi zhiin, te gɔnmimi bǝ zhi te une shar me te une nyɛr ba ir keŋ ndi u na nyer me.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />&lt;&lt;Tetɛɛ, Mdi abaŋ ndi une nǝm aneba ma abɛyi bene bɛm ne amkpa awaŋ ndim yime, tǝ bɛ yik nek ngɔŋ muŋ, nek ŋgɔŋ keŋ ndi uwa une nǝm anekǝ te uwa une nyer me teshe na gɔnmimi.<verse eid="JHN 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />&lt;&lt;Tsetser Tetɛɛ, neme igɔnmimi bane zhiu ba, Nga mne zhiu, fe ne zhi te une shar me. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Mne nduŋu izhi ba, M tei zen duŋ ba zhiu, teduŋ nyer mi iyiŋ ndi iyi ne atu ayi sak muŋ bǝ yi ne atu amen te Nga muŋ yi mbǝ yi ne miŋ men.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Ne vuŋ Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Ndi Yesɔ ne klɛ ben maa, iwa ben abɛ zeu na ndum amaa aglɔ agar ndɔ kɛ Kidro. Nǝ gar kɛ yaa ma lɛmbu ayime, fe uwa ben abɛ zeu na ndum amaa ne gar miŋe.<verse eid="JHN 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Fena, Yahuda ine baŋu lɛbɛ, ne zhi amkpa ane biŋ amene, te amɔ wa Yesɔ ben abɛ zeu na ndum amaa amkpaŋ tetɛk aben abiŋ amɔ. Neme Yahuda ne gar lɛmbumɔ, <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Fe Yahuda ne nyɛ lɛmbumɔ, te gli aner abɛ kpaakpa tetɛk bǝn abɛ ŋub akabakɔŋ ndi ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik bǝn Ferisawa; te gli ilu kɛ laŋ bǝn toci kɛ laŋ ngɔŋ, bǝn ikiki yi tyak kum.<verse eid="JHN 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesɔ ne zhi bɔbɔk iki yiŋ ndi itei teu, fǝ akɔ sɛr akɔmɔ ne ti kɛ aneshire te rib ba, &lt;&lt;Ayi ŋɔwa izhin wɔb bu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />&lt;&lt;Yesɔ awɔnǝ Nazara,&gt;&gt; asagu ma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">&lt;&lt;Ayi Nga wa,&gt;&gt; Yesɔ adi. (Fena Yahuda ne baŋu lɛbɛ aklɛkli ne miŋ mǝne.) <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Ndi Yesɔ ne di, &lt;&lt;Ayi Nga wa,&gt;&gt; akama ru gɔgɔŋ te azhaku ne mimi.<verse eid="JHN 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Atara rib ba, &lt;&lt;Ayi ŋɔwa izhin wɔb bu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Akɔ diu, &lt;&lt;Yesɔ awɔnǝ Nazara.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />&lt;&lt;Mne men blaa zhin te ayi Nga,&gt;&gt; Yesɔ asaga. &lt;&lt;Ate yi ndi izhin wɔb me, fena duŋ zhin aner abaŋa akɔmɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Iki yiŋɛ neyi amɛ teduŋ lǝlɛ yi bla maa bǝ shaga: &lt;&lt;Ba Mne nduŋ izhiin ne miŋ kɛ abaŋ ndi une nǝm ma adɔ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Fena Siman Biturus, ne gli anzigba, atunkɛ ne yene te tsɔm mgbatɔŋ kɛ ŋɔk li ikɛ igen ayou ner ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik akyaŋ. (Isak kɛ gene azhɔu kɛ te Malkus)<verse eid="JHN 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Yesɔ adi Biturus, &lt;&lt;Su anzime ne yene! Bam so ne kuca kɛ yik iyah keŋ ndi Tetɛɛ ne nǝm ne kǝ kai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ne Gli Yesɔ te gar ben Hanana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Ankyak abɛ kpaakpa Romawa tetɛk bǝn ngɔŋ amene ben aner angɔŋgɔŋ aben Yahudawa avuŋ Yesɔ, te kpau <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />tena kuti agliu te gar bǝn Hanana, iwaŋ ndi ayi iyi maa Kayafa, ngɔŋ ne te ambuk ne se mɛ. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Ayi Kayafa waŋ ndi ane nek angɔŋgɔŋ ane Yahudawa lɛ tedi ne rɛ te iner zhiin abɛ ku netu aner bɔbɔk.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Biturus ne tun zhi Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Siman Biturus bǝn izhiin ne miŋ kɛ abɛ zeu tsǝn amaa atsǝn azǝ Yesɔ. Izhiin yuŋɔ ngɔŋ ne te ambuk ne zhiu ngɔŋ, fe ne zǝ Yesɔ akɔmɔ ne kɔb ngɔŋ ne te ambuk. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Ama Biturus ne akam aklɛ ne anɔkɔŋ ake abɛm. Ine yaa ne miŋ abɛ tsene maa waŋ ndi ngɔŋ ne te ambuk ne zhiu, akama ru, te alɛ ben Vǝnwa waŋ ndi wa ayi ne ndum ne bǝn teduŋ Biturus agar ayir miŋ.<verse eid="JHN 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Vǝnwama ndi akǝkle ne anɔkɔŋ adi Biturus, &lt;&lt;Ndi uyi ne miŋ kɛ abaŋ ndi atsǝn bǝn neshir waŋa kai?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Biturus adiu, &lt;&lt;Ɔɔ, bai nga ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Neyi mkpaŋ kɛ mvlu, ndi amɛ agene bǝn abɛ ŋubɔ ne mɔk lu te azǝn vli. Biturus akɛ kli bene ba, azǝn vli lumɔ maa yi.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŋgɔŋ ne te ŋas ne rib Yesɔ lǝlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Ndi amɛ ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik arib Yesɔ ne atu abɛ tsene maa bǝn tsar maa.<verse eid="JHN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Ilɛ muŋ bane yi kuŋkum ba kɔte ŋɔ ne wɔkɛne gɔnmimi.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;kɔte mkpaŋ takɛ Mtsar ne akabakɔŋ, amkpa awaŋ ndi Yahudawa abiŋe. Bam ne Mbla kinuŋ yi suyir ba. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Tǝ urib me neni? Rib abaŋ ndi ne wɔm. M ne zhi te ne zhi kiyi bla muŋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Ndi Yesɔ ne bla amɛ, ngɔŋ nuŋ ne miŋ kɛ angɔngɔŋɔ akɛ kli gbahir te asagu laŋɔk nenu ti. &lt;&lt;Waŋa ir keŋ ndi utei sak ngɔŋ ne te ambuk goi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;atei ndi Mne mbla kinuŋ mimin,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Bla kɔte ŋɔwa abɛ wɔ ilɛ mimin kɛ di muŋɔ. Ama ate yi ndi Mǝ mbla lɛ didik, te uŋur me nenii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Fe Hanana asharu, tena shuru atabɛrbɛr ne aza, te duŋ abaŋu tǝ gar kɔb Kayafa ngɔŋ ne te ambuk.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Biturus ne tun zhi Yesɔ mkpaŋ kɛ yaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Ndi Siman Biturus azǝn vlilu maayi, ne rib bu, &lt;&lt;Ndika u na yi zhiin ne miŋ kɛ abɛ tsene maa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Ama Biturus a tun tedi, &lt;&lt;Ɔɔ bam yi ndɔmɔ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Izhiin ne miŋ kɛ agen abɛ ngɔŋ ne te ambuk go, ayi nga ŋli kɛ waŋ ndi Biturus ane tsɔm mgbatɔŋɔ, awɔbu nǝ lɛ, &lt;&lt;Dikam Mne yigu bene bɔu ne ahwaŋ lɛmbu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Neme Biturus atun, fe ne amkpamkpama agbak akɔ tuk.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ne Gli Yesɔ te gar ben Bilatus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Nǝ gab ye amblimblɛ Yahudawa agli Yesɔ arumɔ bǝn Kayafa te gar ben ŋgɔŋ ine Romawa. Ndi bɛr neka ŋen klɛ, te kǝr abɛ na igyaŋ ne yaŋ yi tsetser ba Yahudawa ba ne yir iki kɛ te ambuk ba; ne wɔb te aba abɛ yi tsetser ne igyaŋ yi tuk glak. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Fe Bilatus Itum aru abɛm te rib te di, &lt;&lt;Izhin di nena anii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Adi, &lt;&lt;Abɛ di bane lalɛ ba, ba ta bǝ gliu te nyɛ ben abɔu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Itum adi, &lt;&lt;Vuŋ zhin ne wu ne tu min te te zhin ambuk kiki min.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Yahudawa adi,&lt;&lt;Ama ba ta yi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ ŋun nuŋ ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Iki yiŋɛ ne na te lɛ keŋ ndi Yesɔ ne bla kɛ ir keŋ ndi iku maa itei yime.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Itum Bilatus akama kɔmɔ ne amkpa ne te ambuk, te zhɔ Yesɔ te rib bu te di, &lt;&lt;Uyi itum ne Yahudawai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Ilɛ kɛ rib kǝŋe ire ben abɔu ka aneshir anuŋ ne blau?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Itum Bilatus asaga te di, &lt;&lt;Uyik te di myi awɔ ne Yahudawai? Ai aneshire ami bǝn ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik aba ne gliu anyɛ bǝn abɛm. Une na anii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Ngɔŋ muŋ bai kɛ gɔnmimi ba. Abɛ di iyi kɛ gɔnmimi, agɛn amuŋ abɛ tsik mgbu te atam azhɔk ne aŋɔk ayi Yahudawa. Ama ngɔŋ muŋ ire amkpanuŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Itum adi, &lt;&lt;Uyi Itum, fena!&gt;&gt; Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Une bla anenen te di Me yi Itum. Le didik, waŋa ai iki yiŋ ndi ne ŋlim, ne me mne nyɛ gɔnmimi, tem mbla zub. Iwaŋ ndi ayi ne na izub awɔm.<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Itum Bilatus arib, &lt;&lt;Anii yi izub o?&gt;&gt; Neme nena ru gar ben Yahudawa te di ba, &lt;&lt;Bam ne yik ner waŋa ne la lɛ nuŋ ba. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Ama ai iki na min te abɛ zhɔk zhin izhiin ne miŋ kɛ abaŋ ndi ne ku ba ne jaru kɔte bɛr yi igyaŋ yi tuk glak. &lt;&lt;Izhin wɔb te bǝ zhɔk zhin &lt;Itum ne Yahudawai&gt;?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Aneshir anuŋ adi, &lt;&lt;ɔɔ, bai wa ba! Nǝk ta Barnaba!&gt;&gt; Ankyak Barnaba ayi ner ne zhib.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="s">Ne nek Yesɔ te bǝ kpaŋu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Ankyak Bilatus aduŋ avuŋ Yesɔ te ashuru asisa ne kpa. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Abɛ kpaakpa ana itu anku kɛ yi ne ncɔŋ te suu ne kǝ ne tu. Te suu anklu akɛ yi ndindilim <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />te nyɛ ben abɔu iyaŋ mkpaŋ te di, &lt;&lt;Ivli mi bɛ baŋ mkpaŋ Itum ane Yahudawa! te tsugu ne laŋɔk&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Amɛ Bilatus nena ru abɛm te di Yahudawa, &lt;&lt;Tɔ zhin, M tei gliu ru zhine te izhin bǝ zhi te bam ne vuŋu ne lalɛ nuŋ ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Ndi Yesɔ ne ru abɛm ne itu anku ikɛ ncɔŋ ndi ne kpa kǝ ne tu maa kɛ yi dindilim, Itum Bilatus adi ba, &lt;&lt;Tɔ zhin neshire waŋ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Ndi ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik bǝn abɛ blɛ Akabakɔŋ ayik Yesɔ, te aŋar akɔr te di, &lt;&lt;kpaŋ zhin ne wu! kpaŋ zhin ne wu!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Ama Bilatus adi ba, &lt;&lt;Izhin bǝ baŋu te kpaŋu. atei nga bam ne yigu ne lalɛ nuŋ ba, Bam yik iki yiŋ ndi ne nai ndi ne mla te abɛ ŋunu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ Yahudawa akyak tedi, &lt;&lt;Ta yine nkan lɛ ndi ne kpai anyak tedi ner waŋa abɛ ku, abaŋ tu maa te wa ayi Izu Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Ndi Bilatus ne awɔ amɛ, sisik ne vuŋu ŋgɔŋ, <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />fe aŋur akam ate yir iki kɛ te ambuk te rib Yesɔ, &lt;&lt;Ure amɛ?&gt;&gt; ama Yesɔ bane bu anu asagu ma ba. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Bilatus adiu, &lt;&lt;Ukyak lɛ ben abɛm mai? Bau ne zhi tem yi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ zhɔ gu ben kɛ kpaŋu ne kuŋkun kɛ gen kai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesɔ asaga, Bau yine mgbyamgbyaŋ ne tu muŋ ba atei ndi mba Arik wa ne nǝgu ne kǝ are shu ba. Fena, iwaŋ ndi ne vuŋ me asak ne aŋɔk ami ilalɛ maa iyi ngɔŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Nak rɛ yiŋɛ Bilatus ne wɔb ankɔŋ ane zuk Yesɔ zhɔk, ama Yahudawa ma akyak te aya atɔŋ, &lt;&lt;Utǝ zuk ner waŋa zhɔk, bau nayi ikpa ayou Keisar ba. Iwaŋ ndi adi iwa ayi itum akama te zor ben Keisar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Ndi Bilatus ne wɔ amɛ, agli Yesɔ arumɔ te azesɔŋ ne mben ne te ambuk ne amkpa awaŋ ndi azhɔu te alɛla mkpaŋ (ndi ne aŋa Yahudawa azhɔu te Gabbata). <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Aneyi bɛr yi na iki li yi igyaŋ yi tuk glak, ne mkpaŋ kɛ tani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:14">&lt;&lt;Tɔ zhin Itum amin waŋ,&gt;&gt; Bilatus adi Yahudawa.<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Ama ashur ahwa, &lt;&lt;Ŋun zhin newu! Ŋun zhin newu! Abɛ kpaŋu ne nkuŋkun!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">&lt;&lt;Izhin di Mǝ mkpaŋ itum amine ne kuŋkune?&gt;&gt; Bilatus arib.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">&lt;&lt;Ba ta yine itum nuŋ ba ayi Keisar ankyak,&gt;&gt; ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik asaga.<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Fe Bilatus abaŋ Yesɔ asak ba ne aŋɔk te bɛ kpaŋu ne kuŋkun kluklu kɛ gen.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Ne kpaŋ Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Fe abɛ kpaakpa ma akɔ vuŋ Yesɔ. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Ne baŋ mkpɔk nkunkun kǝ gen ikɛ kpaŋu ma asagu nɛ mpa, te kɔmɔ ne amkpa ndi azhɔu te akpukpo tu (ndi ne aŋa Yahudawa azhɔu te Golgota). <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Ayaŋa wa ne kpaŋu ne kuŋkuno, ndɔ ben aner anuŋ amɛ ayaa kɔte tawa ne gar nuŋ te Yesɔ wa ne atsutsu.<verse eid="JHN 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Bilatus ne nama cɛr ira nuŋ agli te kɔmɔ ne amkpa awaŋ ndi ne kpaŋ Yesɔ ne kuŋkun kluklu kɛ gene. Icɛre idi: <char style="sc">YESO AWONƏ Nazara, ITUM ANƏ YAHUDAWA</char>. <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Yahudawa tetɛk ne bla cɛrǝ, te amkpa awaŋ ndi ne kpaŋ Yesɔ mɔ ayi gbahir ne miŋ ntun, fena ne cɛr nkan lɛmɛ ne aŋa ayi Yahudawa, Romawa ben Helɛnawa. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Fe ngɔŋ abɛ Yahudawa akɔte di Bilatus, &lt;&lt;Duŋ cɛr &lt;Itum ane Yahudawa ba,&gt; ama ubǝ cɛr tedi,&lt;Iner waŋa adi, nga Myi Itum ane Yahudawa.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Bilatus asaga, &lt;&lt;Iki yiŋ ndi Mne cɛrǝ, bam ntei na yis yi ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Ndi abɛ kpaakpa ma ne kpaŋ Yesɔ, ne vu kiki iyi su maa, agboŋa ntǝk me nas, kɔte ŋɔ ne miŋ mǝne ne Gli mplɛ zhiin, Tena abaŋ ŋa anklu kɛ kpa nyɛn kpa keŋ ndi iyi mplɛ zhiin.<verse eid="JHN 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Abɛ kpaa kpama adi akpa mɛn, &lt;&lt;Kǝr tabǝ gbu kiki yi suu maa ŋa ba, &lt;&lt;Tabǝ shur akeŋkam ka ayi ŋɔwa atei takɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:24">Iyiŋɛ nena te ilɛ kɛ Arik bǝ shaga ikeŋ ndi idi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">&lt;&lt;Ne gab kiki iyi su muŋ ne akpa mɛn tena shur akeŋkam ne mplɛ anklu akɛ kpa amuŋ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Fena waŋa ayi kiyiŋ ndi abɛ kpaa kpama nenai.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Gbahir ne kuŋkun kluklu kɛ gen ndi ne kpaŋ Yesɔ iya maa aklɛkli amɔ, amunvamen ane yaa maa, Meryamu Madalin iwa Kilɔbas, ben Meryamu Magadala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Ndi Yesɔ ne yik yaa maa amɔ, bǝn izhiin ne miŋ kɛ abɛ tsene maa waŋ ndi myeru ngɔŋ ayime amɔ maayi, Yesɔ adi yaa maa, Uwa,tɔ izumi waŋ,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />tena adi ine zeu tsǝne, &lt;&lt;Tɔ iya mi waŋ.&gt;&gt; Ibaŋ rɛ mkpaŋ yuŋɔ, izhiin waŋa ne miŋ kɛ abɛ zeu agli iya maa te kɔmɔ ne kɔmaa.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iku kɛ Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Yesɔ ne zhi te azizaŋa kɔte nii neka shaga; te duŋ ilɛ kɛ Arik iyi zub, Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Ihrie Tǝm.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Ambu anuŋ ayi ne amashir mwamwaŋ ane ama idɔ inabi akur ne miŋe, akɔ dib sɔsɔ ne miŋe, te suu ne mkpɔki lǝlɛ, te lɛk kɛ asuu nenu. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Ndi Yesɔ ne asɔ amashir mwamwaŋ, adi, &lt;&lt;Nǝ ka klɛ.&gt;&gt; Neme, azhɔk tu maa lur te baŋ vli maa.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ne tur Yesɔ ne mashi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Fena ayi bɛr yi gɔŋri, ndi iber te ŋen ayi bɛr iyi sɔŋ sik. Tǝ Yahudawa ba duŋ akum aner ndi ne kpaŋ ba abɛ akɔdɔ ne kuŋkun kluklu kɛ gene ba ne bɛr yi sɔŋ sik, Arib Bilatus te abɛ duŋ ai ka aza mǝne mlik te zi ba shur ne mimi te iber yi sɔŋ sige iyi tsetser. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Fe abɛ kpaakpa ne kɔte ka aza iner ne yi ne ti ndi ne kpaŋ ba ben Yesɔ amlik ben ine yaa maa. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Ama ndi ne nyɛ ben Yesɔ, ne nyɛ yigu neka baŋ tu ayaŋa, bane na ka aza amaa amlik ba. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Nǝ yiŋɛ, izhiin ne miŋ kɛ abɛ kpaa kpama abaŋ mashi atur Yesɔ ne gar sa, ne amkpama azhizhi ben amashir aru. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Iner waŋ ndi ne yik kime ne bla iki ndi iwa ne yigǝ, te iki ndi ne yige ayi izub. Ne zhi te iwa abla zub, ne abla amɛ teduŋ izhineba iminyi bǝ tanyɛmɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Iki yiŋɛ nena amɛ tǝduŋ ilɛ kɛ Arik ibǝ shaga: &lt;&lt;Ba tei ka kuku zhiin amlik nemiŋ kɛ akuku amaa ba,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />ne gar ilɛ kɛ Arik inuŋ idi, &lt;&lt;Aneshir atei yik iwaŋ ndi ne turu ne gar sa ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ne ru ikum kɛ Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Ndi nena, Yusuu awɔnǝ Arimatiya ne ate ben Bilatus te bǝ nek wa ikum kɛ Yesɔ. Yusuu ayi ne zǝ Yesɔ raraŋ, ne klu te kǝr angɔŋgɔŋ ane Yahudawa abɛzhi ba. Nǝ ta nyɛmɛ Bilatus, ne te baŋ kumɔ aglɛ tibɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nikɔdimu ne zeu, ayi iwa ane zǝ Yesɔ agar ne buu. Nikɔdimu ne gli wurdi ine mgbɔ shushum bǝn kiki nuŋ iyi ru aner iye anyaŋ ayi mla azɔb sɔktamgba ane tuŋ. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Iya mǝne abaŋ ikum kɛ Yesɔ, te nyɛn kɛ, ne ŋa anklu aklikla. Ne muɔ ibɛ yayas nuŋ iyimɛ. Waŋa ai yiŋ ndi Yahudawa anama. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Ne amkpa awaŋ ndi ne akpaŋ Yesɔ mɔ, ave ahwaŋa anuŋ ayime, ne miŋ kɛ ave ahwaŋa ne ka ibɛ yayas, ikeŋ ndi bane zǝn zhɔk ine ku inuŋ ne miŋe ba. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Tǝ ayi iber iyi Yahudawa iyi ŋurka te amkpa ane ibɛ kǝ Yesɔ ba lak ba.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Inuŋ ba yi ne bɛme ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Nǝ bɛr yi sɔŋ sik amblimblɛ bib ndi amkpa anaga ri yi buu, Meryamu ne rɛ ntun Magadaliya agar amkpa ane bɛmɛ te kɔte yik ne ŋli mkpaŋ iyi ku anu bɛme aŋyak ne kɔnsa. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Aklu aŋurɔ akam ate bla Siman Biturus bǝn ine zǝ ba tsen inuŋ, iwaŋ ndi Yesɔ anyeru, te di, &lt;&lt;Neka nyɛ abaŋ Yesɔ adɛ me ne miŋ bɛmɛ, fena bata ne zhi amkpa awaŋ ndi ne zhɔ gu ma ba!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Ankyak Biturus ben abɛ zeu tsǝn inuŋ aklu aŋa akpa ta gar ankpa ane bɛ me. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Iyaa mǝne aklu aŋa akpa, fe izhiin ne abɛ tsene maa aklu agara akam Biturus te gar akuti ate yir amkpa ane bɛmɛ. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Akɔte klɔtɔ imiŋ bɛmɛ ta yik ŋa anklu iklikla keŋ ndi ne nyɛnu ma iyi sha ama bane yir miŋe ba. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Ankyak Siman Biturus anyɛ, te agara gu ayir imiŋ bɛmɛ, ate yik ŋa anklumɔ ikukur ne amkpama, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />bǝn ŋa anklu akǝŋ ndi ne nyɛnu ne tu mɔ ne rik tena kam nyɛn ne tu maa, bane dus biŋ bǝn ŋa anklu klikla ma ba. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Fe ndi ine tsene maa nuŋ amen kuti klu te yir bɛmɛ, akɔ yir miŋe maayi. Ne yik te tanyɛmɛ. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Bane zǝn zhi ne bla ilɛ kɛ Arik te Yesɔ atei lu ne ku ba.<verse eid="JHN 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Fena abɛ zeu tsǝn amaa akam akɔmɔ ne akɔb amen,<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne muŋ aruu Meryamu Madalin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Meryamu aklɛkli nenu bɛ me te azǝn zhin, azedɔ nenu bɛ me tǝ wa abɛ aklɔtɔ <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />fe akɔ yik abɛ shar ayou Arik amɛ yaa ne nkluŋklu klikla akɔsɔŋ ne amkpa awaŋ ndi ne zi ikum kɛ Yesɔ azhɔgo, inuŋ ne shin kɛ aza inuŋ ne gar kɛ tu maa.<verse eid="JHN 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Akɔ rib bu, &lt;&lt;Iwa, uzhin anii?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">&lt;&lt;Ne abaŋ Ŋgɔŋ amuŋ agli atibe,&gt;&gt; adi ba, &lt;&lt;Fena bam ne zhi amkpa awaŋ ndi ne azhɔgu ma ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Ndi amɛ, akɔ akam te yik Yesɔ akɛ kli amɔ, ama bane zhi te ayi Yesɔ ba.<verse eid="JHN 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Fe Yesɔ adiu &lt;&lt;Iwa,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Uzhin anii? Ayi ŋɔwa uwɔbui?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Nǝ yik maa ayi nǝ blɛ amkpa, te diu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔŋ, ate yi ndi unǝ baŋu gli tibɛ, blam amkpa awaŋ ndi une nyagu ma, tem kɔte baŋu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Meryamu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Aŋur akama agar bene bɔu tɛ kɔ zhin ne aŋa Yahudawa, &lt;&lt;Rabboni!&gt;&gt; (watɔ &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ&gt;&gt;).<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesɔ adiu, duŋ rim gli ba, te bam Mne zen ŋurkam kɔmɔ ben Tetɛɛ ba. Ndi amɛ kɔmɔ ben amunzumɔr te bla ba, &lt;Mkam ŋurkam kɔmɔ ben Tetɛɛ muŋ ben Tetɛɛ min iminyi, Arik amuŋ ben Arik amin.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Meryamu ine rɛ ntun magadaliya akɔmɔ ben abɛ zeu tsǝn amaa ne lɛ kɛ men: &lt;&lt;Mniyik Ŋgɔŋ!&gt;&gt; Fe akɔ bla ba kiki ndi Yesɔ ne bla wa neyi.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ ne amuno ruu abɛ zeu tsǝn amaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Nǝ bɛr yi sɔŋ sik amgbalu, ndi abɛ tsene maa ne biŋ te ku nkuŋkɔŋ bǝn wundɔ, te ne te sisik angɔngɔŋ aner abɛ Yahudawa. Ankyak Yesɔ anyɛ yir miŋ mǝne tedi ba, &lt;&lt;Isɔŋ kǝ sik bǝ yi ne atu amin&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Ndi ne adi amɛ, atsar ba ala ŋɔk amaa bǝn gar sa maa. Abɛ tsene maa akɔ nyɛr ŋgɔŋ ndi neyik Ŋgɔŋ.<verse eid="JHN 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesɔ atara di ba, &lt;&lt;Isɔŋ kɛ sik susun bǝyi bene bɛ zhin! Ir keŋ ndi Tetɛɛ ne shar me, Ŋgam na shar zhin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Ankyak akɔ zhɔk ivli ashur ba tedi, &lt;&lt;Ta zhin Izhu Tsetser. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Izhin te zuk lalɛ iyi nuŋ zhɔk, ne zugu zhɔk; mbazhin te zuk lalɛ mǝne zhɔk ba, bane zu gu azhɔk ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ ne amuno ruu Tɔma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Izhiin ne miŋ kɛ abɛ zeu ntsan amaa, Tɔma (azhɔu te Atagwe), bane yi ne mkpaŋ keŋ ndi Yesɔ ne gara ba. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Fe nki abɛ tsene maa ablau, &lt;&lt;Tane yik Ŋgɔŋ!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Ama akɔ diba, &lt;&lt;Se Mniyik mak mkpaŋ kɛ kpaŋ kusa ne aŋɔk amaa, te M sak vǝnŋɔk muŋ ne amkpama tena su vǝnŋɔk ne yisa maa neliŋ, Bam tanyɛmɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Ndi Sati zhiin ne gayir abɛ tsene maa nena tuŋ abiŋ ne kɔbɔ, ndi Tɔma ne yime. Nǝ zhi men ne ku nkuŋkɔŋɔ, Yesɔ anyɛ klɛ ne miŋ mǝne tedi, &lt;&lt;Isɔŋ kǝ sik bene bɛ zhin!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Fe akɔ di Tɔma, &lt;&lt;Sak vǝnŋɔk mi ayaŋ; tɔ ala ŋɔk amuŋ ai zub. Duŋ susun mi bǝ tanyɛmɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tɔma asagu ma, Ŋgɔŋ amuŋ ben Arik amuŋ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Fe ndi une yik me teshe tanyɛmɛ; anu adidik ayi ne atu abaŋ ndi bane yik ba tǝ nɛ tanyɛmɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iki yiŋ ndi ne duŋ icɛr yiŋɛ yime.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesɔ nena kiki iyi vuŋ anu tetɛk neyi abɛ tsene maa, ndi bane cɛrǝ ashur ne icɛr iyiŋɛ ba. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Ama ne cɛr kiki yiŋ te izhin bǝ tanyɛme te Yesɔ wa ayi Kristi me, Izu Arik, fena ne tanyɛmɛ min izhin tei yik vli ne sak maa.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ ne amuno ruu abɛ zeu tsǝn amaa amɛ ataŋgba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Ndi iyiŋɛ ne gayir, Yesɔ nena muno ruu abɛ zeu tsǝn amaa, ne Inǝk ne Tibiriya. Waŋa ayi ir keŋ ndi ne nama: <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Siman Biturus, Tɔma (ine zhɔ te atagwe), Nataniyel awɔnǝ Kana ne Galili, amun Zebɛdi, ben abɛ zeu tsǝn amaa anuŋ amɛ yaa ayi ndɔ. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Fena Siman Biturus adi nkime, &lt;&lt;Mru ngar vu ambɛ,&gt;&gt; fe akɔ diu, &lt;&lt;Ta tei gar ndɔ.&gt;&gt; Ankyak akɔ ru te kɔte yir miŋ igu, ama ne bu iyi bǝn bane vuŋ ikinuŋ ba.<verse eid="JHN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Ndi anzaŋ azǝn ru, Yesɔ akɛ kli ne kɔtɔŋ inege, ama abɛ zeu tsǝn amaa bane zhi te ayi Yesɔ ba.<verse eid="JHN 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Fe Yesɔ azhɔ ba tedi, &lt;&lt;Akpaamuŋ, ba zhin ne vuŋ ambe nuŋ ka?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">&lt;&lt;Ɔɔ, akɔ asagu ma.<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Adi, &lt;&lt;Tyak burgi amine ne gar kɛ ŋɔk li ne tɔŋ gumɔ te izhin tei vu anuŋ.&gt;&gt; Ndi nena ne bla maa, bane gbaŋ burgime aru ayir ba te ambɛ tetɛk ayi ne miŋ burgime.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Fe izhiin ne abɛ tsene maa iwaŋ ndi anyeru ma adi Biturus, &lt;&lt;Ayi Ŋgɔŋ!&gt;&gt; Ndi Siman Biturus anak awɔu adi amɛ, &lt;&lt;Ayi Ŋgɔŋ,&gt;&gt; akɔ gen anklu ake abɛm amaa ne kpa (ane mǝne tun kɛ aŋyak) te tuk aku ne miŋ amashir. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Nki abɛ tsene maa azeu ne igu, agbur burgime ne ambɛ tetɛk ne miŋe, te anaga ri yi ne miŋ lelɔ inege, ilak gab mkpaŋ aza amkplik azhiin ne mimi. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Ndi ne te ru ganki abɛm, neyik ne mɔk lu te ten ambɛ me, ben mwɔ borodi.<verse eid="JHN 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Glim azhin amɔ ambɛ anuŋ abaŋ ndi izhin ne vumɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Siman Biturus ayir miŋ gumɔ te agbaŋ burgime agar kɔtɔŋ inege ne ambɛ tetɛk, 153, idu kɛ ambɛ ne miŋ burgime bane gbu aŋa ba. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Nye zhin te tabǝ li kili iye amblimblɛ.&gt;&gt; Ba nuŋ ne miŋ kɛ abɛ zeu tsǝn amaa ne rib bu ba, &lt;&lt;Uyi ŋɔwai?&gt;&gt; Ne zhi te ayi Ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Fe Yesɔ alu agar, abaŋ borodime te nyɛr Arik te nek ba; tena amɛ ne ambɛ me. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Waŋa ayi mkpaŋ kɛ ntar ndi Yesɔ amuno ruu abɛ zeu tsǝn amaa ndi neka lu ne ku.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ ben Biturus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Ndi neka li aklɛ, Yesɔ adi Siman Biturus, &lt;&lt;Siman izu Yɔɔna, une tanyɛme bene bɛm ilɛ didik inaŋ abaŋa yi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Siman Biturus adiu &lt;&lt;E, Ŋgɔŋ,&gt;&gt;, &lt;&lt;Une zhi te mne tanyɛme bene bɔu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Yesɔ adiu, Yɔk awanta amuŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Yesɔ atara adiu mkpaŋ kɛ yaa, &lt;&lt;Siman izu Yɔɔna, unyer me ilɛ didik?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Ata nyɛmɛ tedi, &lt;&lt;E, Ŋgɔŋ, une zhi tem ne tanyɛme bene bɔu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Ŋub awanta amuŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Mkpaŋ kɛ ntar Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Siman izu Yɔɔna, &lt;&lt;Une tanyɛme bene bɛm i?&gt;&gt; Biturus akɔ abaŋ afuk ne ir keŋ ndi Yesɔ atara rib wa mkpaŋ kɛ ntar, &lt;&lt;Une tanyɛme bene bɛm i?&gt;&gt; Biturus adiu, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, une zhi kiki yiŋɛ bɔbɔk; une zhi tem ne tanyɛme bene bɔu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Yɔk awanta amuŋ. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Ngam blau lɛ didik, indi une ri yi vǝnenzak uduŋ ne tu mi te kɔmɔ ne amkpa ndi ugar; ama ndi utǝ cɛ, utei nab aŋɔk teduŋ inuŋ ashe suu anklu te gliu agar amkpa awaŋ ndi bɔu ne diu ugaru ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Yesɔ abla amɛ tǝ wa abɛ tsar ir kɛ ku keŋ ndi itei vuŋ Biturus te duŋu abɛ nek Arik ngɔŋ. Fe akɔ diu, &lt;&lt;Zǝm!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ben ne zeu tsǝn ndi anyɛru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Biturus akam yik izhiin ne miŋ kɛ abɛ tsene maa iwaŋ ndi Yesɔ anyɛruma atsene zǝ ba. (Iwaŋ ndi neyi gbahir ne amkpa ane li kili iye amblimblɛ ndɔ ben Yesɔ tedi, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, ayi ŋɔwa atei baŋu alɛb i?&gt;&gt;) <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Ndi Biturus ne yigu, akɔ rib, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, tǝ wa fa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Ate yi ndi M tei duŋu abɛyi tsitsir mla ne mkpaŋ kɛ nyɛ muŋ, anii mi iyi ne miŋei? Utei zǝm ne mgbyamgbyaŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Ndi ne yi amɛ, iduk lɛmen ne yir miŋ kɛ amunya te izhiin ne miŋ kɛ abɛ tsene maa batei ku ba. Ama Yesɔ baa ne di ba wa atei yaŋ ku ba, &lt;&lt;Mte nduŋu ayi tsitsir mla ne nyɛ muŋ, anii iyi mi ne miŋei?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Waŋa ayi ne miŋ kɛ abɛ tsene maa ndi ne yik kiki yiŋɛ tena cɛrǝ asak. Tane zhi te iki iyiŋ ndi ne blai ai lɛ didik.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Yesɔ nena kikinuŋ tetɛk iyiŋ ndi ai bɛdi ne cɛrǝ zhi zhin bɔbɔk, igɔnmimi ne tu maa batei hru mgbɔk lɛ kǝ cɛrǝ yir ba.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>